item.game:dots.name = Dots and Boxes
item.game:duel.desc = Read the tell, beat the draw.
item.game:duel.name = Sound Duel
item.game:echoes.desc = Map a cavern with sonar alone.
item.game:echoes.name = Echoes
item.game:echoloc.desc = Ping the dark, judge the echo, and strike the hidden target.
item.game:echoloc.name = Echo Location
item.game:eights.desc = Be first to empty your hand, matching suit or number, eights wild.
item.game:eights.name = Crazy Eights
item.game:elevator.desc = Take them where they asked to go.
item.game:elevator.name = The Lift
item.game:fighters.desc = Read the tell, block, punish.
item.game:fighters.name = Fighters
item.game:fire.desc = Put it out before it spreads.
item.game:fire.name = Firefighter
item.game:fireeater.desc = Breathe in. Hold. Blow on the beat.
item.game:fireeater.name = Fire Eater
item.game:fireflies.desc = Fireflies blink across the field. Move the jar under one and catch it.
item.game:fireflies.name = Firefly Jar
item.game:fishing.desc = Sonar fishing in the dark.
item.game:fishing.name = Deep Listen
item.game:fivedice.desc = Roll five dice up to three times a turn and fill thirteen boxes.
item.game:fivedice.name = Five Dice
item.game:forklift.desc = Fetch the pallet. Mind the racking.
item.game:forklift.name = Forklift
item.game:fourrow.desc = Four of yours in a line before the rival gets four of theirs.
item.game:fourrow.name = Four in a Row
item.game:frisbee.desc = Line up, wait, and catch.
item.game:frisbee.name = Frisbee Beach
item.game:gaplength.desc = Which silence lasted longer?
item.game:gaplength.name = Mind The Gap
item.game:gators.desc = Five lanes, hungry gators, and a frenzy for the best.
item.game:gators.name = Gator Bop
item.game:gems3.desc = Swap ringing gems to line up three or more of a kind.
item.game:gems3.name = Gem Chimes
item.game:ghost.desc = Eat the dots, dodge the growl.
item.game:ghost.name = Ghost Chase
item.game:ghosttrain.desc = Something is in the carriage with you.
item.game:ghosttrain.name = Ghost Train
item.game:golf.desc = Six holes by ear, from tee to cup.
item.game:golf.name = Golf
item.game:gomoko.desc = Five in a row on a nine by nine board, against the computer.
item.game:gomoko.name = Gomoko
item.game:gridiron.desc = Call the play, find the open man, and march down the field.
item.game:gridiron.name = Gridiron
item.game:guessnum.desc = Higher? Lower? Close in on the secret number.
item.game:guessnum.name = Guess the Number
item.game:hammer.desc = Wind up and hit it dead on.
item.game:hammer.name = High Striker
item.game:hammer2.desc = Swing the hammer round, faster each turn, and let it fly.
item.game:hammer2.name = Hammer Throw
item.game:hammurabi.desc = Rule ancient Sumeria for ten years: land, grain and people.
item.game:hammurabi.name = Hammurabi
item.game:handbells.desc = Hear the tune once, then ring your two bells in their places.
item.game:handbells.name = Handbells
item.game:harmonics.desc = One note in the chord is out.
item.game:harmonics.name = Find The Sour Note
item.game:hexapawn.desc = Three pawns each on a tiny board, against a rival that learns.
item.game:hexapawn.name = Hexapawn
item.game:highdive.desc = Let go at the top of the bounce.
item.game:highdive.name = High Dive
item.game:highjump.desc = Run up in rhythm, take off on the mark.
item.game:highjump.name = High Jump
item.game:highlow.desc = Two tones ring. Which came more often?
item.game:highlow.name = High Or Low Count
item.game:hockey.desc = Block the puck, then bury it.
item.game:hockey.name = Air Hockey
item.game:homerun.desc = Read the pitch, swing on the pop, and send it over the fence.
item.game:homerun.name = Home Run Derby
item.game:hoopla.desc = Ring the prize. Mind the swing.
item.game:hoopla.name = Hoopla
item.game:hotpotato.desc = Catch it, hear who is calling, throw it on. Before it bursts.
item.game:hotpotato.name = Hot Potato
item.game:hurdles.desc = Sprint, and time the leap over ten hurdles.
item.game:hurdles.name = 110 Metres Hurdles
