item.game:rpsbeat.name = Rock Paper Beat
item.game:running.desc = Keep the total in your head as the numbers come.
item.game:running.name = Running Total
item.game:sale.desc = So much off. What do you pay?
item.game:sale.name = Sale Price
item.game:scalerun.desc = Follow the scale up and down.
item.game:scalerun.name = Scale Runner
item.game:sequence.desc = Four numbers. What comes next?
item.game:sequence.name = Sequence Finder
item.game:signalhunt.desc = Tune through the static, lock on, and count the pulses.
item.game:signalhunt.name = Signal Hunt
item.game:skeeball.desc = Nine balls, five rings, and two pockets worth a hundred.
item.game:skeeball.name = Skee-Ball
item.game:skeet.desc = Pull! Track the clay across the sky and fire.
item.game:skeet.name = Skeet Shooting
item.game:slalom.desc = Ski the gates by ear, tuck for speed.
item.game:slalom.name = Slalom
item.game:slide.desc = Slide numbered tiles back into order around the one gap.
item.game:slide.name = Tile Slide
