item.music:boss.desc = Heavy low-end themes for every cabinet.
item.music:boss.name = Boss Pack
item.music:carnival.desc = Bright fairground themes across the arcade.
item.music:carnival.name = Carnival Pack
item.music:chase.desc = Fast phrygian panic music.
item.music:chase.name = Chase Pack
item.music:deepspace.desc = Wide, slow, weightless themes.
item.music:deepspace.name = Deep Space Pack
item.music:dream.desc = Slow, wide, floating themes.
item.music:dream.name = Dream Pack
item.music:funk.desc = Syncopated bass and bright leads.
item.music:funk.name = Funk Pack
item.music:maqam.desc = Hijaz and Nahawand themes across the arcade.
item.music:maqam.name = Maqam Pack
item.music:noir.desc = Slow, smoky themes for the small hours.
item.music:noir.name = Night Pack
item.music:parade.desc = Marching, brassy themes.
item.music:parade.name = Parade Pack
item.perk:coach.desc = Spoken hints when you keep missing the same thing.
item.perk:coach.name = Coach
item.perk:continue.desc = One extra life per game, forever.
item.perk:continue.name = Continue Token
item.perk:fourth.desc = A fourth daily mission every day, with its own reward; all four for the day's bonus.
item.perk:fourth.name = Fourth Mission
item.perk:gemfinder.desc = Earn gems on a smaller margin over your record.
item.perk:gemfinder.name = Gem Polish
item.perk:goldeye.desc = Gold medals need a tenth fewer points.
item.perk:goldeye.name = Golden Eye
item.perk:guide.desc = Lists the achievements you have not earned yet, with what each one asks, and a hint for the secret ones.
item.perk:guide.name = Achievement Guide
item.perk:jukebox.desc = Five fresh arrangements of every cabinet's theme: each time you sit down to play, its music is composed anew. Also opens every style in the jukebox.
item.perk:jukebox.name = Jukebox Plus
item.perk:magnet.desc = A quarter more tickets from every game.
item.perk:magnet.name = Ticket Magnet
item.perk:practice.desc = Play any game with no score and no lives.
item.perk:practice.name = Practice Room
item.perk:retry.desc = Restart a game from the results screen without walking back.
item.perk:retry.name = Instant Retry
item.perk:skip.desc = Skip one round per game without losing a life.
item.perk:skip.name = Round Skip
item.perk:slowstart.desc = Every game begins one difficulty step easier.
item.perk:slowstart.name = Gentle Start
item.perk:speed.desc = Adjust any game's speed from the pause menu.
item.perk:speed.name = Speed Dial
item.perk:stats.desc = A per-game breakdown of your bests and averages.
item.perk:stats.name = Score Card
item.voice:bell.desc = Everything chimes. Bright and long.
item.voice:bell.name = Bell Chip
item.voice:cinematic.desc = Deep, filmic hits with real weight under every sound.
item.voice:cinematic.name = Cinematic
item.voice:crunchy.desc = Three-bit crushed sound bank. Loud and rude.
item.voice:crunchy.name = Crunchy Chip
item.voice:deep.desc = Everything an octave down. Feels enormous.
item.voice:deep.name = Deep Chip
item.voice:glass.desc = Bright ringing sound bank with long tails.
item.voice:glass.name = Glass Chip
item.voice:mellow.desc = Soft triangle-led sound bank, easy on the ears.
item.voice:mellow.name = Mellow Chip
item.voice:metal.desc = Hard, ringing effects with a long tail.
item.voice:metal.name = Metal Chip
item.voice:paper.desc = Soft, rustling effects. Barely there.
item.voice:paper.name = Paper Chip
item.voice:warm.desc = Organic, rounded effects with air and body -- no hard chip edges at all.
item.voice:warm.name = Warm Studio
item.voice:wooden.desc = Dry, knocking effects. Like a puppet theatre.
item.voice:wooden.name = Wooden Chip


# ---- Achievements ----------------------------------------------

ach.achievement_hub.desc = Open the achievements list.
ach.achievement_hub.flavour = You came to read your own trophy case. And look, that very act was one of them. The list is a little bit alive.
ach.achievement_hub.name = Trophy Case
ach.achievement_hub_20.desc = Open the achievements list twenty times.
ach.achievement_hub_20.flavour = Twenty visits to the trophy case. You are not playing for score any more, you are playing for the list. We respect it.
ach.achievement_hub_20.name = Curator
ach.all_123.desc = Play every game in the arcade.
ach.all_123.flavour = Every cabinet in the building, all {games} of them. There is nothing here you have not heard.
ach.all_123.name = Every Last Cabinet
ach.all_banks.desc = Own every sound bank.
ach.all_banks.flavour = Every colour the effects come in is yours now.
ach.all_banks.name = Full Palette
ach.all_engines_heard.desc = Hear the music through all five engines.
ach.all_engines_heard.flavour = Chip, analogue, FM, acoustic and hybrid. Same songs, five completely different bands playing them.
ach.all_engines_heard.name = Every Orchestra
ach.all_engines_lab.desc = Play a Sound Lab game on every engine.
ach.all_engines_lab.flavour = The same perception test through five different instruments. The distinctions hold, which is rather the point.
ach.all_engines_lab.name = Lab Coat
ach.all_engines_one_game.desc = Play the same game on three different engines.
ach.all_engines_one_game.flavour = The same cabinet, three different orchestras. The game did not change. Everything about it changed.
ach.all_engines_one_game.name = Same Song, Five Bands
ach.all_worlds_gold.desc = Earn five stars in every world.
ach.all_worlds_gold.flavour = Five stars in all {worlds} worlds. There is nothing left in this building to prove.
ach.all_worlds_gold.name = Full House
ach.all_worlds_one_session.desc = Play a game from every world in one session.
ach.all_worlds_one_session.flavour = Every world visited in a single sitting. You walked the whole building.
ach.all_worlds_one_session.name = Grand Tour
ach.alley_1000.desc = Win a thousand tickets in Ticket Alley.
ach.alley_1000.flavour = A thousand tickets from the machines that pay nothing else.
ach.alley_1000.name = Ticket Alley Regular
ach.arcade_rat.desc = Play a hundred games in total.
ach.arcade_rat.flavour = A hundred games. Somewhere in there you stopped reading the instructions and started just knowing.
ach.arcade_rat.name = Arcade Rat
ach.archery_gold_10.desc = Shoot ten golds in Archery.
ach.archery_gold_10.flavour = Ten arrows in the middle, wind or no wind.
ach.archery_gold_10.name = Bullseye Collector
ach.artillery_5.desc = Land five direct hits in Artillery.
ach.artillery_5.flavour = Five direct hits. Short, long, then dead on: that is how ranging has always worked.
ach.artillery_5.name = Ranging Shot
ach.asteroid_500.desc = Score five hundred in Asteroids.
ach.asteroid_500.flavour = Five hundred points of rock, all of it located by bearing.
ach.asteroid_500.name = Rock Breaker
ach.atc_10.desc = Land ten aircraft in one shift.
ach.atc_10.flavour = Ten aircraft down safely and nobody came close to anybody.
ach.atc_10.name = Clear Skies
ach.axe_150.desc = Score 150 in Axe Throw.
ach.axe_150.flavour = Spin, spin, thunk. The target has more axes than wood left.
ach.axe_150.name = Timber!
ach.battleship_150.desc = Score 150 in Battleship.
ach.battleship_150.flavour = Splash, splash, boom. Their whole fleet is resting on the seabed.
ach.battleship_150.name = Admiral
ach.bearings_15.desc = Point at fifteen sounds accurately.
ach.bearings_15.flavour = Fifteen bearings taken by ear. This is the skill the whole arcade rests on, and you have been drilling it.
ach.bearings_15.name = True North
ach.beat_100.desc = Score a hundred in Beat Blaster.
ach.beat_100.flavour = In the pocket. Every note where it was meant to be.
ach.beat_100.name = In The Pocket
ach.beat_own_best.desc = Beat your own record by a single point.
ach.beat_own_best.flavour = You beat your own record by one. The smallest possible improvement and it counts exactly as much.
ach.beat_own_best.name = By One
ach.beat_perfect.desc = Land twenty perfect hits in a row in Beat Blaster.
ach.beat_perfect.flavour = Twenty perfect hits without a single one drifting. There are drum machines with worse timing than that.
ach.beat_perfect.name = Metronome Human
ach.beat_perfect_50.desc = Land fifty perfect beats in a row.
ach.beat_perfect_50.flavour = Fifty perfect hits consecutively. The metronome is not leading you any more, you are running alongside it.
ach.beat_perfect_50.name = Locked In
ach.beatstar_10.desc = Reach level ten in Beatstar.
ach.beatstar_10.flavour = Sixteenths at a gallop, and the band still followed you.
ach.beatstar_10.name = Headliner
ach.beatstar_5.desc = Reach level five in Beatstar.
ach.beatstar_5.flavour = Odd meters, new keys, quicker notes, and you kept the phrase.
ach.beatstar_5.name = Rising Star
ach.beatstar_star.desc = Bring on Star Power in Beatstar with a long run of perfect notes.
ach.beatstar_star.flavour = Sixteen notes right on the beat, one after another.
ach.beatstar_star.name = Star Power
ach.bee_15.desc = Find fifteen flowers in Bumblebee.
ach.bee_15.flavour = Fifteen flowers, all found by following the buzz. The hive thanks you.
ach.bee_15.name = Busy Bee
ach.bee_route.desc = Find five flowers without a single wrong turn.
ach.bee_route.flavour = Five flowers and you never once flew the wrong way. You are reading the buzz, not hunting for it.
ach.bee_route.name = Efficient Route
ach.beeps_250.desc = Score 250 in Beep Counter.
ach.beeps_250.flavour = However fast the burst, you never lost count.
ach.beeps_250.name = Every Beep Counted
ach.bells_perfect.desc = Ring every note of a Handbells concert without a single miss.
ach.bells_perfect.flavour = Eight tunes, and not one bell out of place.
ach.bells_perfect.name = Pride Of The Choir
ach.berzerk_out.desc = Escape the robot maze.
ach.berzerk_out.flavour = Out, with the clanking still behind you.
ach.berzerk_out.name = Out Of The Maze
ach.best_in_five.desc = Set a personal best five games running.
ach.best_in_five.flavour = Five bests back to back. You are improving faster than you are playing.
ach.best_in_five.name = Five In A Row
ach.biggersum_500.desc = Score 500 in Bigger Sum.
ach.biggersum_500.flavour = Left or right, bigger or smaller, decided in a flash.
ach.biggersum_500.name = Quick Comparison
ach.birdsong_300.desc = Score 300 in Bird Song.
ach.birdsong_300.flavour = Every call learned, every repeat caught.
ach.birdsong_300.name = Birdwatcher
ach.blackjack_200.desc = Finish Blackjack with 200 chips.
ach.blackjack_200.flavour = Twice what you sat down with. The dealer is counting the shoe.
ach.blackjack_200.name = Double Your Money
ach.blind_win.desc = Win a game with No Hints mode on.
ach.blind_win.flavour = No commentary, no guidance, nothing but the game's own sounds. And you won.
ach.blind_win.name = No Hints Needed
ach.boing_50.desc = Reach fifty bounces in Boing.
ach.boing_50.flavour = Fifty bounces with the window shrinking under you the whole way.
ach.boing_50.name = Fifty Bounces
ach.boss_rush.desc = Clear a Boss Rush.
ach.boss_rush.flavour = You went to every world and beat the worst thing in it. Back to back. Without stopping.
ach.boss_rush.name = Boss Slayer
ach.boss_rush_two.desc = Clear Boss Rush twice.
ach.boss_rush_two.flavour = Twice through the hardest cabinet in every world. The second time was easier, which is the frightening part.
ach.boss_rush_two.name = Boss Hunter
ach.both_ends.desc = Play both after midnight and before six.
ach.both_ends.flavour = You have played at both ends of the night. Do not let the arcade become the reason.
ach.both_ends.name = Round The Clock
ach.bowling_200.desc = Bowl a game of 200 or more.
ach.bowling_200.flavour = Two hundred. Real bowlers frame that score and hang it on the wall.
ach.bowling_200.name = Two Hundred Club
ach.boxes_700.desc = Take home 700 or more in Mystery Boxes.
ach.boxes_700.flavour = The banker blinked first. You kept your nerve and your box.
ach.boxes_700.name = No Deal
ach.boxing_ko.desc = Win a bout of Boxing by knockout.
ach.boxing_ko.flavour = Slip, counter, and the referee counts to ten.
ach.boxing_ko.name = Down For The Count
ach.breakout_clear.desc = Clear a whole wall in Breakout.
ach.breakout_clear.flavour = The wall is gone. Every brick, tracked by pitch alone.
ach.breakout_clear.name = Wall Breaker
ach.broke.desc = Spend down to fewer than ten coins.
ach.broke.flavour = Down to your last few coins. Spent, not lost, which is the good way to run out.
ach.broke.name = Empty Pockets
ach.browsed.desc = Open the prize counter.
ach.browsed.flavour = You have found the prize counter. Everything on those shelves is yours eventually. Some of it is yours today.
ach.browsed.name = Window Shopper
ach.bulls_150.desc = Score 150 in Bulls and Cows.
ach.bulls_150.flavour = Right place, wrong place, and then every digit home. Suggested by Elissar.
ach.bulls_150.name = Code Cracker
ach.bumper_10.desc = Land ten clean hits in Bumper Cars.
ach.bumper_10.flavour = Ten clean hits from behind and not one taken.
ach.bumper_10.name = Demolition
ach.calibrated.desc = Calibrate the game to your screen reader.
ach.calibrated.flavour = You taught the arcade how you hear it. Now every word lands exactly when it should.
ach.calibrated.name = Tuned In
ach.candy_10.desc = Eat ten candies from the Ticket Booth.
ach.candy_10.flavour = Ten sweets, and every one of them a boost.
ach.candy_10.name = Sweet Tooth
ach.capsule_1.desc = Open a capsule at the capsule machine.
ach.capsule_1.flavour = A crank, a clunk, a pop, and something tiny for your shelf.
ach.capsule_1.name = Pop Goes The Capsule
ach.career_crowds.desc = Welcome ten thousand visitors to your arcade.
ach.career_crowds.flavour = Ten thousand people through the doors.
ach.career_crowds.name = Ten Thousand Visitors
ach.career_done.desc = Reopen every hall of your arcade.
ach.career_done.flavour = From a dusty ruin to the busiest arcade in town. It is yours.
ach.career_done.name = Proprietor
ach.career_expansion.desc = Open all three new wings of your arcade.
ach.career_expansion.flavour = The terrace, the lanes and the annex: the finest arcade in the land.
ach.career_expansion.name = The Grand Annex
ach.career_first.desc = Repair your first cabinet as the Arcade Owner.
ach.career_first.flavour = One machine humming again. The rest of the hall is listening.
ach.career_first.name = Open For Repairs
ach.career_first_event.desc = Host an event at your arcade.
ach.career_first_event.flavour = Posters all over town, and a queue at the door.
ach.career_first_event.name = Grand Opening
ach.career_five.desc = Reopen five halls of your arcade.
ach.career_five.flavour = Five halls back in business, and word is spreading.
ach.career_five.name = Half The Town Is Talking
ach.career_five_stars.desc = Raise your arcade to a five-star rating.
ach.career_five_stars.flavour = The best rating there is, and every star of it earned.
ach.career_five_stars.name = Five Stars
ach.career_full_staff.desc = Hire every member of staff for your arcade.
ach.career_full_staff.flavour = Music, food, prizes and a mechanic. The place runs itself.
ach.career_full_staff.name = A Full Team
ach.career_hall.desc = Reopen a hall of your arcade.
ach.career_hall.flavour = The lights are on and the first customers wander in.
ach.career_hall.name = Ribbon Cut
ach.career_requests_10.desc = Deliver ten of the regulars' requests.
ach.career_requests_10.flavour = Ten scores, ten happy regulars, ten tips.
ach.career_requests_10.name = Crowd Pleaser
ach.career_requests_50.desc = Deliver fifty of the regulars' requests.
ach.career_requests_50.flavour = Fifty requests. The regulars ask for you by name.
ach.career_requests_50.name = Everybody's Favourite
ach.career_rival_1.desc = Beat all three of the rival arcade's records in one week.
ach.career_rival_1.flavour = Pixel Palace's champions are not champions any more.
ach.career_rival_1.name = Across Town
ach.career_rival_5.desc = Beat the rival arcade's records in five different weeks.
ach.career_rival_5.flavour = Five weeks running the town's best. Pixel Palace is very quiet.
ach.career_rival_5.name = Nobody Goes There Now
ach.career_ten_events.desc = Host ten events at your arcade.
ach.career_ten_events.flavour = Ten events, and the town marks them on its calendar.
ach.career_ten_events.name = Party Planner
ach.career_three_stars.desc = Raise your arcade to a three-star rating.
ach.career_three_stars.flavour = The papers have noticed. So has the competition.
ach.career_three_stars.name = Three Stars
ach.career_tycoon.desc = Welcome a hundred and twenty thousand visitors and reach the top owner's rank.
ach.career_tycoon.flavour = From a stall keeper to a tycoon, one visitor at a time.
ach.career_tycoon.name = Tycoon Of The Town
ach.career_upgrades.desc = Buy every improvement for your arcade.
ach.career_upgrades.flavour = Nothing left to fit. Every corner shines.
ach.career_upgrades.name = Fully Fitted
ach.career_window_full.desc = Fill your arcade's window display.
ach.career_window_full.flavour = Your three best, on show to the whole street.
ach.career_window_full.name = Window Dressing
ach.carnival_all.desc = Play every booth in Carnival Row.
ach.carnival_all.flavour = Every booth on the row has taken your coin and given something back.
ach.carnival_all.name = Midway Master
ach.carnival_first.desc = Play a game in Carnival Row.
ach.carnival_first.flavour = The midway is open. It is louder out here, and the booths are not interested in being fair.
ach.carnival_first.name = Step Right Up
ach.carnival_full.desc = Play ten different Carnival Row booths.
ach.carnival_full.flavour = Ten booths on the midway. You have handed over a lot of coins out here and taken a fair few back.
ach.carnival_full.name = Carnival Row Regular
ach.cctv_10.desc = Spot ten intruders on the cameras.
ach.cctv_10.flavour = Ten of them, each found by a tremor in a hum that was supposed to be steady.
ach.cctv_10.name = Nothing Gets Past
ach.change_400.desc = Score 400 in Make Change.
ach.change_400.flavour = Not a coin out of place all shift. The customers will be back.
ach.change_400.name = Honest Till
ach.checkpoint_250.desc = Score 250 in Checkpoint.
ach.checkpoint_250.flavour = Hum, click, silence, step. The station doors never touched you.
ach.checkpoint_250.name = Cleared For Entry
ach.chords_20.desc = Name twenty chords correctly.
ach.chords_20.flavour = Twenty chords named by ear. That is music theory you now own.
ach.chords_20.name = Chord Reader
ach.classic_full.desc = Play ten different Classic Corner cabinets.
ach.classic_full.flavour = Ten of the old machines, all rebuilt for the ear. Some of these shapes are older than the idea of playing them blind.
ach.classic_full.name = Classic Corner Regular
ach.claw_win.desc = Actually win a prize from the Claw Machine.
ach.claw_win.flavour = You beat the claw. Nobody beats the claw. We are as surprised as you are.
ach.claw_win.name = Rigged, Obviously
ach.climb_50.desc = Climb fifty metres.
ach.climb_50.flavour = Fifty metres of swinging holds, each one grabbed dead centre.
ach.climb_50.name = Fifty Metres
ach.clock_200.desc = Score 200 in Time Keeper.
ach.clock_200.flavour = Forward or back, hours or minutes, the clock never caught you out.
ach.clock_200.name = Right On Time
ach.clock_addict.desc = Check the time a hundred times.
ach.clock_addict.flavour = A hundred glances at the clock. You play to the whistle.
ach.clock_addict.name = Against The Clock
ach.clock_watcher.desc = Check the time in a game with T.
ach.clock_watcher.flavour = You asked how long was left rather than guessing. The clock will always tell you.
ach.clock_watcher.name = Clock Watcher
ach.coconut_10.desc = Knock down ten coconuts.
ach.coconut_10.flavour = Ten coconuts off their posts, thrown at things you could only hear.
ach.coconut_10.name = Good Arm
ach.codebreaker_500.desc = Score 500 in Codebreaker.
ach.codebreaker_500.flavour = Bright chime, wooden knock, bright chime. Then all bright.
ach.codebreaker_500.name = Safecracker
ach.coins_250.desc = Score 250 in Coin Drop.
ach.coins_250.flavour = Clink, knock, chime, tick. You knew exactly what was in the jar.
ach.coins_250.name = Counting House
ach.collector.desc = Collect fifty coins in a single Coin Rush.
ach.collector.flavour = Fifty coins caught out of the air by ear.
ach.collector.name = Coin Magnet
ach.collector_all.desc = Own every item in the prize counter.
ach.collector_all.flavour = Every prize on every shelf is yours. The counter is bare. You have beaten the shop.
ach.collector_all.name = Everything Unlocked
ach.comeback.desc = Come back to a game right after rage quitting it.
ach.comeback.flavour = You stormed off and then you came straight back. That is the exact shape of everyone who ever got good at anything.
ach.comeback.name = Never Say Die
ach.comeback_king.desc = Come back and finish twenty games you had walked away from.
ach.comeback_king.flavour = Twenty comebacks. A walked-off cabinet is not a loss to you, just a pause.
ach.comeback_king.name = Comeback King
ach.comeback_ten.desc = Win ten times from the brink.
ach.comeback_ten.flavour = Ten comebacks. You have stopped treating a last life as a loss.
ach.comeback_ten.name = Never Out Of It
ach.comeback_win.desc = Win after being one life from the end.
ach.comeback_win.flavour = One life left and you turned it around. Those are the ones you remember.
ach.comeback_win.name = From Behind
ach.complete_100.desc = Reach one hundred percent completion.
ach.complete_100.flavour = Every cabinet, every medal, every prize. Nothing left. Well, until the next update.
ach.complete_100.name = Arcadelux Complete
ach.complete_50.desc = Reach fifty percent completion.
ach.complete_50.flavour = Half of everything the arcade holds is yours.
ach.complete_50.name = Halfway There
ach.completionist.desc = Earn two hundred achievements.
ach.completionist.flavour = Two hundred. There is a version of this arcade that exists only in your save file, and it is nearly complete.
ach.completionist.name = Nothing Left
ach.continue_never.desc = Win fifty games without ever using a continue.
ach.continue_never.flavour = Fifty wins and the continue token still unspent in your pocket.
ach.continue_never.name = Purist
ach.copycat_15.desc = Reach fifteen in Copycat.
ach.copycat_15.flavour = Fifteen phrases copied back exactly, pitch and rhythm both.
ach.copycat_15.name = Word For Word
ach.counterpoint_20.desc = Catch twenty repeats while a second line plays.
ach.counterpoint_20.flavour = Twenty repeats caught with another melody deliberately in the way. Ignoring a sound is far harder than hearing one.
ach.counterpoint_20.name = Divided Attention
ach.counterpoint_50.desc = Catch fifty repeats in Two At Once.
ach.counterpoint_50.flavour = Fifty, while a second melody did everything it could to pull you away. That is a trained attention.
ach.counterpoint_50.name = Two Minds
ach.counting_20.desc = Count twenty groups of beeps correctly.
ach.counting_20.flavour = Twenty counts, no miscounts, some of them far too fast to be fair.
ach.counting_20.name = Good Count
ach.cubehop_5.desc = Clear five Cube Hop boards.
ach.cubehop_5.flavour = Five boards turned over without ever landing twice. That is memory and planning at once.
ach.cubehop_5.name = Clean Sweep
ach.cups_10.desc = Get ten rounds right in Cup Tap.
ach.cups_10.flavour = Ten rounds of following something you cannot see.
ach.cups_10.name = Sharp Eye
ach.curb_10.desc = Cross ten times in Curb.
ach.curb_10.flavour = Ten crossings and not one guess. You waited for real gaps.
ach.curb_10.name = Ten Crossings
ach.curling_100.desc = Score 100 in Curling.
ach.curling_100.flavour = Stone after stone, slid and swept to the middle of the house.
ach.curling_100.name = On the Button
ach.cyclone_jackpot.desc = Stop the Cyclone on its jackpot.
ach.cyclone_jackpot.flavour = The bells, the lights, and a ribbon of tickets that will not stop.
ach.cyclone_jackpot.name = Jackpot!
ach.daily_first.desc = Play a daily challenge.
ach.daily_first.flavour = The daily. Same seed for everyone, everywhere, today only.
ach.daily_first.name = Today's Puzzle
ach.daily_month.desc = Play thirty daily challenges.
ach.daily_month.flavour = Thirty dailies. Same puzzle as everyone else, thirty days running.
ach.daily_month.name = Thirty Days
ach.daily_played.desc = Play seven daily challenges.
ach.daily_played.flavour = Seven days, seven puzzles, the same one for every player everywhere.
ach.daily_played.name = Daily Grind
ach.daily_streak_3.desc = Play the daily challenge three days running.
ach.daily_streak_3.flavour = Three days without missing the daily. The habit is forming.
ach.daily_streak_3.name = Three In A Row
ach.daily_streak_30.desc = Play the daily thirty days running.
ach.daily_streak_30.flavour = Thirty days without a gap. The daily is not a thing you play any more, it is a thing you are.
ach.daily_streak_30.name = Unbroken Month
ach.daily_streak_7.desc = Play the daily seven days running.
ach.daily_streak_7.flavour = A full week of dailies, one after another. That is a streak worth protecting.
ach.daily_streak_7.name = Perfect Week
ach.daily_week.desc = Play seven daily challenges.
ach.daily_week.flavour = A full week of dailies. That is a habit now, not a visit.
ach.daily_week.name = Seven Days
ach.dawn_patrol.desc = Play a game at five in the morning.
ach.dawn_patrol.flavour = Five in the morning. Whatever brought you here, the machines do not mind.
ach.dawn_patrol.name = Dawn Patrol
ach.decant_3.desc = Solve three Decant puzzles in one run.
ach.decant_3.flavour = Three tubes sorted purely by pitch. No colours anywhere.
ach.decant_3.name = Steady Pour
ach.decathlon_1.desc = Finish a Decathlon.
ach.decathlon_1.flavour = Every event in the arena, one after another, all the way to the end.
ach.decathlon_1.name = Decathlete
ach.decathlon_6000.desc = Score 6000 points in one Decathlon.
ach.decathlon_6000.flavour = A thousand points an event, and some to spare.
ach.decathlon_6000.name = Champion of the Arena
ach.defuse_5.desc = Defuse five bombs in a row.
ach.defuse_5.flavour = Five bombs, five correct wires, no explosions. Your ear for a detuned note is now a marketable skill.
ach.defuse_5.name = Bomb Squad
ach.defuse_800.desc = Score 800 in Bomb Defuser.
ach.defuse_800.flavour = Snip, snip, silence. The best sound in the building.
ach.defuse_800.name = Wire Whisperer
ach.die_150.desc = Score 150 in Rolling Die.
ach.die_150.flavour = Away, left, towards, right, and you still knew which face was up.
ach.die_150.name = Loaded Die
ach.dive_deep.desc = Bank fifteen pearls in one dive session.
ach.dive_deep.flavour = Fifteen pearls, and you came up every single time. Knowing when to surface is the whole game.
ach.dive_deep.name = Lungful
ach.dive_nobreath.desc = Bank pearls without ever drowning in a session.
ach.dive_nobreath.flavour = A whole session and you never once ran out of air. You surfaced when you needed to, which is the entire skill.
ach.dive_nobreath.name = Cool Head
ach.docking_5.desc = Dock five times without a crash.
ach.docking_5.flavour = Five clean dockings: centred, and slow enough to matter.
ach.docking_5.name = Clean Approach
ach.dodge_120.desc = Survive two minutes in Meteor Dodge.
ach.dodge_120.flavour = Two minutes under a sky that never stopped falling.
ach.dodge_120.name = Two Minutes Under Fire
ach.dodge_60.desc = Survive sixty seconds in Meteor Dodge.
ach.dodge_60.flavour = A full minute under falling rock without a scratch.
ach.dodge_60.name = Untouchable
ach.doors_150.desc = Score 150 in Cursed Doors.
ach.doors_150.flavour = You remembered every right door, and the curse never caught up.
ach.doors_150.name = Curse Breaker
ach.dots_5.desc = Beat the arcade at Dots and Boxes five times.
ach.dots_5.flavour = Never the third side, always the fourth.
ach.dots_5.name = Boxed In
ach.dots_two.desc = Play Dots and Boxes with a friend.
ach.dots_two.flavour = Two players, one keyboard, and a grid of dots between you.
ach.dots_two.name = Pencil And Paper
ach.double_best.desc = Double one of your own high scores.
ach.double_best.flavour = Twice your old best on the same cabinet. Whatever clicked, it clicked properly.
ach.double_best.name = Twice As Good
ach.drumfill_8.desc = Play back a fill of eight hits.
ach.drumfill_8.flavour = Eight hits in order, from one hearing. Drummers train for that.
ach.drumfill_8.name = Session Drummer
ach.duck_10.desc = Bag ten ducks in one round.
ach.duck_10.flavour = Ten birds down, and not once did you fire at the dog.
ach.duck_10.name = Good Dog
ach.duck_odd.desc = Catch five intruder ducks.
ach.duck_odd.flavour = Five impostors picked out of a noisy flock. That is a very fine ear for a very small difference.
ach.duck_odd.name = Spot The Stranger
ach.duel_500.desc = Score 500 in Sound Duel.
ach.duel_500.flavour = You heard their move coming and answered first.
ach.duel_500.name = Last One Standing
ach.duel_win.desc = Beat the champion in Sound Duel.
ach.duel_win.flavour = The champion is beaten. You read every tell before it landed.
ach.duel_win.name = Sound Duelist
ach.early_bird.desc = Play before six in the morning.
ach.early_bird.flavour = Before six. Either you are up very early or you never went to bed, and only one of those deserves congratulating.
ach.early_bird.name = Early Bird
ach.earned_of = {got} of {total} earned
ach.echoes_all.desc = Find every crystal in Echoes.
ach.echoes_all.flavour = Every crystal in the cavern, mapped from echoes and nothing else.
ach.echoes_all.name = Full Survey
ach.echoloc_500.desc = Score 500 in Echo Location.
ach.echoloc_500.flavour = A ping, an echo, and a strike right on the mark.
ach.echoloc_500.name = Bat Ears
ach.egg_20.desc = Gather twenty eggs in one Egg Hunter round.
ach.egg_20.flavour = Twenty eggs in one basket, and the chicken never laid a wing on you.
ach.egg_20.name = Egg Baron
ach.egg_50.desc = Collect fifty eggs in one round.
ach.egg_50.flavour = Fifty eggs, one basket, one hen doing her best to stop you.
ach.egg_50.name = Basket Full
ach.egg_boost.desc = Trigger the speed boost in Egg Hunter.
ach.egg_boost.flavour = Five eggs in seven seconds. The field blurs a bit at that speed.
ach.egg_boost.name = Turbo Basket
ach.egg_boost_5.desc = Trigger the boost five times in one round.
ach.egg_boost_5.flavour = Five boosts in a single round. At that point you are barely touching the ground.
ach.egg_boost_5.name = Permanent Blur
ach.egg_hen.desc = Catch the chicken in Egg Hunter.
ach.egg_hen.flavour = You turned the hunt around and caught the hunter. It did not see that coming, and neither did we.
ach.egg_hen.name = Fox In The Henhouse
ach.eight_worlds.desc = Play three different games in every world.
ach.eight_worlds.flavour = Three cabinets in every room of the building. You know the place by ear now.
ach.eight_worlds.name = Well Travelled
ach.eights_10.desc = Win ten hands of Crazy Eights.
ach.eights_10.flavour = The dealer is running out of eights to hide.
ach.eights_10.name = Card Shark
ach.elevator_25.desc = Deliver twenty-five passengers.
ach.elevator_25.flavour = Twenty-five passengers, several aboard at once, every floor remembered.
ach.elevator_25.name = Going Up
ach.endless_ten.desc = Play ten games in the Practice Room.
ach.endless_ten.flavour = Ten runs where losing was switched off. The only thing you took away was the skill.
ach.endless_ten.name = No Such Thing As Losing
ach.engine_all.desc = Switch sound engines ten times.
ach.engine_all.flavour = Ten times you changed how the whole arcade is played. Nobody settles on one without trying them all again.
ach.engine_all.name = Residency
ach.engine_swap.desc = Switch to a different sound engine.
ach.engine_swap.flavour = New engine. Same songs, different musicians. Listen to what the melody does when it is handed to somebody else.
ach.engine_swap.name = Change The Band
ach.escape_artist.desc = Quit out of fifty games.
ach.escape_artist.flavour = Fifty escapes. You have developed a refined sense of when a run is already over. That is a skill, even if it is not a proud one.
ach.escape_artist.name = Escape Artist
ach.escape_master.desc = Quit out of two hundred games.
ach.escape_master.flavour = Two hundred escapes. At this point the escape key is worn smooth and we should probably talk.
ach.escape_master.name = Houdini
ach.every_bank_heard.desc = Play a game in every sound bank.
ach.every_bank_heard.flavour = Nine different palettes of effects. Same games, and yet not.
ach.every_bank_heard.name = Every Colour
ach.every_cabinet.desc = Buy every cabinet at the prize counter.
ach.every_cabinet.flavour = Every cabinet in the building is yours now. Someone fetch the keys.
ach.every_cabinet.name = Owner Of The Arcade
ach.every_mood.desc = Hear every mood of music.
ach.every_mood.flavour = Every style the composer knows, heard at least once. It writes them fresh each time, so none of those performances exist any more.
ach.every_mood.name = Whole Soundtrack
ach.every_world_star.desc = Earn five stars in five different worlds.
ach.every_world_star.flavour = Five worlds with nothing left to prove. The rest of the building is starting to worry.
ach.every_world_star.name = Five Stars, Five Worlds
ach.fast_win.desc = Win a game with the speed dial above a hundred and twenty percent.
ach.fast_win.flavour = Faster than the designer intended, and still a win.
ach.fast_win.name = Taken Fast
ach.fiftieth_run.desc = Start the arcade fifty times.
ach.fiftieth_run.flavour = Fifty visits. At this point you may as well have your own key to the place.
ach.fiftieth_run.name = Key Holder
ach.fifty_cabinets.desc = Play fifty different games.
ach.fifty_cabinets.flavour = Fifty different machines. Most players never find half of them.
ach.fifty_cabinets.name = Fifty Cabinets
ach.fifty_hours.desc = Play for fifty hours in total.
ach.fifty_hours.flavour = Fifty hours of generated sound, none of it ever recorded, none of it repeatable. All of it made for you as you went.
ach.fifty_hours.name = Fifty Hours
ach.fighter_ko.desc = Win a fight by knockout.
ach.fighter_ko.flavour = Knockout. Every tell read, every opening taken.
ach.fighter_ko.name = Knockout
ach.figures_15.desc = Collect fifteen different capsule figures.
ach.figures_15.flavour = Fifteen little figures, lined up in a row.
ach.figures_15.name = Half The Set
ach.figures_all.desc = Collect all thirty capsule figures.
ach.figures_all.flavour = Common, rare and super rare, every one of them yours.
ach.figures_all.name = Every Last Figure
ach.fire_out.desc = Put out an entire block of fires.
ach.fire_out.flavour = Every fire out. Another minute and it would have had the block.
ach.fire_out.name = All Out
ach.first_best.desc = Set your first personal best.
ach.first_best.flavour = Your first record. It only has to beat the person you were yesterday, and it did.
ach.first_best.name = New Record
ach.first_coins.desc = Earn your first coins.
ach.first_coins.flavour = Coins. They come out of playing well and they go into the shelves at the counter. That is the whole economy.
ach.first_coins.name = Pocket Change
ach.first_escape.desc = Quit out of a game with escape.
ach.first_escape.flavour = You pressed escape. No shame in it. Some cabinets are not for today, and today is not the last day.
ach.first_escape.name = Nope
ach.first_hour.desc = Play for a full hour in total.
ach.first_hour.flavour = An hour in the building. Long enough to have favourites.
ach.first_hour.name = First Hour
ach.first_run.desc = Start the arcade for the first time.
ach.first_run.flavour = Congratulations. You have run this thing for the very first time. The lights are on, the machines are warm, and nobody else is here yet. Let us hope you come back many more times.
ach.first_run.name = Doors Open
ach.first_steps.desc = Play your very first game.
ach.first_steps.flavour = One coin in, one game played. Everything else in this list is downstream of that.
ach.first_steps.name = First Coin
ach.first_unlock.desc = Unlock your first item.
ach.first_unlock.flavour = Your first unlock. Something in this building exists now that did not exist for you an hour ago.
ach.first_unlock.name = Something New
ach.first_win.desc = Win a game for the first time.
ach.first_win.flavour = Your first win. Take a moment. The machines do not usually lose.
ach.first_win.name = First Blood
ach.fishing_500.desc = Score 500 in Fishing.
ach.fishing_500.flavour = A good bite, a patient hand, and a very full bucket.
ach.fishing_500.name = The One That Didn't Get Away
ach.fishing_whale.desc = Land a whale in Deep Listen.
ach.fishing_whale.flavour = You heard something enormous down there in the dark, and you brought it up.
ach.fishing_whale.name = The Big One
ach.five_dice_five.desc = Score five of a kind at Five Dice.
ach.five_dice_five.flavour = Five dice, one face, fifty points.
ach.five_dice_five.name = Five Alike
ach.five_hundred.desc = Play five hundred games in total.
ach.five_hundred.flavour = Five hundred. This is no longer a thing you tried. It is a thing you do.
ach.five_hundred.name = Five Hundred Games
ach.five_minute.desc = Survive five minutes in one game.
ach.five_minute.flavour = Five minutes. At that point the cabinet is not testing your reflexes any more, it is testing your concentration.
ach.five_minute.name = Marathon Run
ach.flappy_10.desc = Pass ten walls in Flappy Tone.
ach.flappy_10.flavour = Ten gaps threaded by matching your pitch to theirs.
ach.flappy_10.name = Ten Walls
ach.flawless_five.desc = Finish five games without a mistake.
ach.flawless_five.flavour = Five clean runs. That is not a good day, that is a level.
ach.flawless_five.name = Immaculate
ach.flawless_game.desc = Finish a game without a single mistake.
ach.flawless_game.flavour = Not one error the whole way through. Some games you survive; this one you simply did.
ach.flawless_game.name = Not A Scratch
ach.floor_all.desc = Walk into every hall of the arcade floor.
ach.floor_all.flavour = Every hall, every aisle, on your own two feet.
ach.floor_all.name = Grand Tour On Foot
ach.floor_first.desc = Walk onto the arcade floor.
ach.floor_first.flavour = The attendant waves, the cabinets call, and the floor is yours.
ach.floor_first.name = Through The Doors
ach.footsteps_10.desc = Sneak past ten guards.
ach.footsteps_10.flavour = Ten guards, none of whom heard a thing. You moved only when the room was loud.
ach.footsteps_10.name = Light Footed
ach.forklift_10.desc = Deliver ten pallets.
ach.forklift_10.flavour = Ten pallets to the bay. The racking is still standing, mostly.
ach.forklift_10.name = Certified
ach.fourrow_90.desc = Score 90 in Four in a Row.
ach.fourrow_90.flavour = Across, up and on the slant. The rival never saw the fourth one coming.
ach.fourrow_90.name = Four On The Floor
ach.freethrow_30.desc = Score 30 in Free Throws.
ach.freethrow_30.flavour = Thirty points from the line, the hoop found by its call alone.
ach.freethrow_30.name = Nothing But Net
ach.frisbee_20.desc = Catch twenty frisbees.
ach.frisbee_20.flavour = Twenty caught, and you had the sense to let the dangerous ones sail past.
ach.frisbee_20.name = Good Hands
ach.gators_angry.desc = Reach the bonus round in Gator Bop.
ach.gators_angry.flavour = Fifty seconds of bopping, and the gators took it personally.
ach.gators_angry.name = Now They're Angry
ach.gauntlet_all.desc = Clear a Gauntlet in every world.
ach.gauntlet_all.flavour = Seven worlds, each beaten end to end on one life. There is no part of this arcade that has your measure.
ach.gauntlet_all.name = Every Gauntlet
ach.gem_first.desc = Earn a gem by beating one of your records decisively.
ach.gem_first.flavour = A gem. You did not merely beat your old score, you left it behind. There is a hall for people like you, and it has just opened.
ach.gem_first.name = First Gem
ach.gem_five.desc = Open five prize doors.
ach.gem_five.flavour = Five doors. You are earning gems faster than you can spend them, which is a very good problem.
ach.gem_five.name = Regular At The Hall
ach.gem_hoard.desc = Hold five gems at once.
ach.gem_hoard.flavour = Five gems in your pocket and the Hall right there. What exactly are you saving them for?
ach.gem_hoard.name = Gem Hoard
ach.gem_spender.desc = Open a prize door in the Rewards Hall.
ach.gem_spender.flavour = One gem in, one door open. Nobody, including me, knows what is behind any of them until you pull the handle.
ach.gem_spender.name = Prize Door
ach.gem_twenty.desc = Open twenty prize doors.
ach.gem_twenty.flavour = Twenty doors. You are earning gems faster than the Hall can stock prizes.
ach.gem_twenty.name = Gem Collector
ach.gems3_chain.desc = Set off ten chains in Gem Chimes.
ach.gems3_chain.flavour = Gem after gem falling into place and ringing out again.
ach.gems3_chain.name = Chain Reaction
ach.gems_hundred.desc = Earn a hundred gems across your whole time here.
ach.gems_hundred.flavour = A hundred gems, each one a record broken by a clear margin. The Rewards Hall knows you by name.
ach.gems_hundred.name = Gem Hoarder
ach.ghost_clear.desc = Clear a maze in Ghost Chase.
ach.ghost_clear.flavour = Every dot taken with something hunting you the whole time.
ach.ghost_clear.name = Maze Muncher
ach.ghost_survive.desc = Survive the Ghost Train.
ach.ghost_survive.flavour = All the way through without bailing out. Whatever was in there with you did not get a hand on you.
ach.ghost_survive.name = Nerve Intact
ach.golf_500.desc = Score 500 in a round of Golf.
ach.golf_500.flavour = Driver, iron, wedge, putter, and the cup heard every time.
ach.golf_500.name = Under Par
ach.guessnum_200.desc = Score 200 in Guess the Number.
ach.guessnum_200.flavour = Higher, lower, higher, got it. Every secret number gave itself away.
ach.guessnum_200.name = Mind Reader
ach.guide.hint = Hint: {v0}
ach.guide.item = Not yet: {v0}, worth {v1} coins
ach.guide.secret = A secret, worth {v0} coins
ach.hammer_70.desc = Throw the hammer seventy metres.
ach.hammer_70.flavour = Four perfect pulls, and away it went.
ach.hammer_70.name = Hammer Time
ach.hammer_bell.desc = Ring the bell on the High Striker.
ach.hammer_bell.flavour = The bell. Released at exactly the top of the swing.
ach.hammer_bell.name = Ring The Bell
ach.hardcore_10.desc = Play ten games in Hardcore Mode.
ach.hardcore_10.flavour = Ten hardcore runs. You have recalibrated what normal speed means and you are going to notice when you go back.
ach.hardcore_10.name = No Handrails
ach.hardcore_fifty.desc = Win fifty games in hardcore mode.
ach.hardcore_fifty.flavour = Fifty hardcore wins. Normal speed must feel like wading now.
ach.hardcore_fifty.name = Hardcore Regular
ach.hardcore_hundred.desc = Finish a hundred games in Hardcore mode.
ach.hardcore_hundred.flavour = A hundred hardcore runs. Normal mode must feel like it is standing still now.
ach.hardcore_hundred.name = No Mercy Asked Or Given
ach.hardcore_on.desc = Switch on Hardcore Mode.
ach.hardcore_on.flavour = Hardcore. Everything faster, coins doubled, sympathy withdrawn.
ach.hardcore_on.name = Turn It Up
ach.hardcore_ten.desc = Finish twenty-five games in Hardcore mode.
ach.hardcore_ten.flavour = Twenty-five hardcore runs. You turned off the safety rails and kept your feet anyway.
ach.hardcore_ten.name = The Hard Way
ach.hardcore_win.desc = Win a game in hardcore mode.
ach.hardcore_win.flavour = Everything faster, everything in three dimensions, and you still came out ahead.
ach.hardcore_win.name = Hardcore Winner
ach.highjump_2m.desc = Clear two metres in High Jump.
ach.highjump_2m.flavour = Two metres up and over, on a run-up you kept in rhythm by ear.
ach.highjump_2m.name = Two Metres
ach.highlow_80.desc = Score 80 in High or Low.
ach.highlow_80.flavour = Up or down, you knew before the note had finished.
ach.highlow_80.name = Called It
ach.hockey_win.desc = Win a game of Air Hockey.
ach.hockey_win.flavour = Five goals. The table is yours.
ach.hockey_win.name = Table Champion
ach.hoopla_10.desc = Ring ten prizes in Hoopla.
ach.hoopla_10.flavour = Ten rings, each thrown at the one instant the swing lined up.
ach.hoopla_10.name = Ringer
ach.hot_5.desc = Play the Hot Cabinet five times.
ach.hot_5.flavour = Wherever the heat is, you are there.
ach.hot_5.name = Feeling The Heat
ach.hour_in_one.desc = Play a single game for a full ten minutes.
ach.hour_in_one.flavour = Ten unbroken minutes in one cabinet. Whatever it was, it had you.
ach.hour_in_one.name = Marathon Sitting
ach.hub_bounce.desc = Back out of the main menu ten times without playing.
ach.hub_bounce.flavour = Ten times into the room and back out again without touching a machine. Some evenings are like that.
ach.hub_bounce.name = In And Out
ach.hundred_bests.desc = Set a hundred personal bests.
ach.hundred_bests.flavour = A hundred times you have been better than you used to be. That is what the numbers were always for.
ach.hundred_bests.name = Century Of Records
ach.hundred_ten.desc = Play a hundred and ten different games.
ach.hundred_ten.flavour = A hundred and ten cabinets. Only a handful are left that you have never tried.
ach.hundred_ten.name = A Hundred And Ten
ach.hurdles_clean.desc = Clear all twenty hurdles cleanly in a meeting of 110 Metres Hurdles.
ach.hurdles_clean.flavour = Two races, twenty hurdles, and not one of them so much as trembled.
ach.hurdles_clean.name = Not A Hurdle Touched
ach.idle.desc = Leave a menu open for two minutes without touching anything.
ach.idle.flavour = The menu waited. The music looped. Somewhere a machine wondered where you had gone.
ach.idle.name = Still There?
ach.instant_quit.desc = Quit a game within three seconds of starting it.
ach.instant_quit.flavour = In and straight back out. You heard one note and knew it was not the evening you had in mind.
ach.instant_quit.name = Second Thoughts
ach.intervals_20.desc = Name twenty intervals correctly.
ach.intervals_20.flavour = Twenty intervals named by ear. Musicians pay for lessons in this.
ach.intervals_20.name = Named Every One
ach.invaders_wave10.desc = Reach wave ten in Space Invaders.
ach.invaders_wave10.flavour = Ten waves. They come faster every time and you are still ahead of them.
ach.invaders_wave10.name = Tenth Wave
ach.invaders_wave5.desc = Reach wave five in Space Invaders.
ach.invaders_wave5.flavour = Five waves down. They march faster every time and you kept up.
ach.invaders_wave5.name = Wave Five
ach.joust_10.desc = Win ten passes in Joust.
ach.joust_10.flavour = Ten passes won on height alone. You are hearing the difference between their altitude and yours, which is a strange skill to have.
ach.joust_10.name = Unhorsed Them
ach.juggler_300.desc = Score 300 in Juggler.
ach.juggler_300.flavour = Hands that keep time with things you cannot see.
ach.juggler_300.name = Five Ball Cascade
ach.juke_fifty.desc = Play fifty tracks in the Jukebox.
ach.juke_fifty.flavour = Fifty tracks spun. You know this composer's voice as well as it knows yours.
ach.juke_fifty.name = Resident DJ
ach.juke_first.desc = Play ten tracks in the Jukebox.
ach.juke_first.flavour = Ten tracks queued up just to listen. The jukebox is starting to know your taste.
ach.juke_first.name = Take A Request
ach.jukebox_addict.desc = Listen to a hundred generated tracks.
ach.jukebox_addict.flavour = A hundred tracks. At some point this stopped being an arcade to you and became a radio station.
ach.jukebox_addict.name = Sat In The Lobby
ach.jukebox_all_moods.desc = Hear every mood in the jukebox.
ach.jukebox_all_moods.flavour = Every style the composer knows, on demand. None of those performances will ever happen again.
ach.jukebox_all_moods.name = Complete Collection
ach.jukebox_fan.desc = Listen to twenty generated tracks.
ach.jukebox_fan.flavour = Twenty songs pulled out of the machine. You are digging through crates of records that are being pressed as you flip past them.
ach.jukebox_fan.name = Crate Digger
ach.jukebox_first.desc = Use the jukebox.
ach.jukebox_first.flavour = The jukebox. Every track in there is composed on the spot and has never existed before you asked for it, and will not exist again unless you remember the seed.
ach.jukebox_first.name = Put A Song On
ach.keycutter_500.desc = Score 500 in Key Cutter.
ach.keycutter_500.flavour = Notch by notch by ear. Every lock in town opens for your keys.
ach.keycutter_500.name = Master Locksmith
ach.kitchen_25.desc = Serve twenty-five dishes.
ach.kitchen_25.flavour = Twenty-five plates out, three pans at once, nothing burnt. Any kitchen would have you.
ach.kitchen_25.name = Service
ach.knight_400.desc = Take all ten flags in Knight's Path with the fewest jumps.
ach.knight_400.flavour = Two and one, two and one, and never a jump wasted.
ach.knight_400.name = Knight Errant
ach.lab_all_first.desc = Play all fifteen Sound Lab cabinets.
ach.lab_all_first.flavour = Every instrument in the Lab. You have measured your own hearing from fifteen different directions.
ach.lab_all_first.name = Every Instrument
ach.lab_bearing_tight.desc = Point within five degrees of a sound.
ach.lab_bearing_tight.flavour = Five degrees. That is better than most people manage with their eyes open.
ach.lab_bearing_tight.name = Dead Ahead
ach.lab_first.desc = Play a game in the Sound Lab.
ach.lab_first.flavour = The Lab does not ask you to dodge anything. It asks what you can actually hear, which turns out to be a harder question.
ach.lab_first.name = Into The Lab
ach.lab_full.desc = Play ten different Sound Lab cabinets.
ach.lab_full.flavour = Ten instruments of the Lab. Every distinction you sharpen here makes the rest of the building easier, whether you notice it or not.
ach.lab_full.name = Sound Lab Regular
ach.lab_precision.desc = Tune a note to within ten cents.
ach.lab_precision.flavour = Ten cents. A tenth of a semitone, judged by wobble alone.
ach.lab_precision.name = Fine Tolerance
ach.lab_tempo_tight.desc = Match a tempo to within two beats a minute.
ach.lab_tempo_tight.flavour = Two beats a minute. Drummers would take that.
ach.lab_tempo_tight.name = Metronomic
ach.labyrinth_fast.desc = Escape the Labyrinth with time to spare.
ach.labyrinth_fast.flavour = Out of the labyrinth with the clock still running. No wrong turns worth mentioning.
ach.labyrinth_fast.name = Quick Escape
ach.lander_3.desc = Land three times in one Lunar Lander run.
ach.lander_3.flavour = Three soft landings on one tank of nerve.
ach.lander_3.name = Steady Hands
ach.language_switch.desc = Play the arcade in more than one language.
ach.language_switch.flavour = You have heard this building speak in two tongues. Everything you hear was written twice, on purpose.
ach.language_switch.name = Bilingual
ach.laser_clean.desc = Clear all sixty beams of Laser Run without a zap.
ach.laser_clean.flavour = Sixty beams, and every one of them missed you.
ach.laser_clean.name = Not A Scorch Mark
ach.launch_400.desc = Score 400 in Launch Control.
ach.launch_400.flavour = Gust after gust, and the engine never left the middle for long.
ach.launch_400.name = Orbit Reached
ach.layout_both.desc = Play with both key layouts.
ach.layout_both.flavour = Arrows and the home row. Whichever suits the day.
ach.layout_both.name = Both Hands
ach.layout_change.desc = Change the direction or action keys.
ach.layout_change.flavour = You moved the controls to where your hands actually are. That is not a workaround, that is the program doing its job.
ach.layout_change.name = Made It Yours
ach.letters_200.desc = Score 200 in Letter Sums.
ach.letters_200.flavour = A plus A, B minus three: every letter gave up its digit.
ach.letters_200.name = Code Breaker
ach.level_10.desc = Reach player level ten.
ach.level_10.flavour = Level ten. Every game you have ever played fed this number, win or lose. It only ever goes up.
ach.level_10.name = Seasoned
ach.level_20.desc = Reach player level twenty.
ach.level_20.flavour = Level twenty. This is not a number you grind for. It is a number that quietly accumulated while you were having fun.
ach.level_20.name = Veteran
ach.level_25.desc = Reach player level twenty-five.
ach.level_25.flavour = Level twenty-five, and the prize counter has a few things on its top shelf that only now come down for you.
ach.level_25.name = Past The Veterans
ach.level_30.desc = Reach player level thirty.
ach.level_30.flavour = Level thirty. A fourth mission a day is yours to buy now.
ach.level_30.name = Thirty Up
ach.level_35.desc = Reach player level thirty-five.
ach.level_35.flavour = Level thirty-five. A badge that no single bad run could ever have dented, earned across hundreds of them.
ach.level_35.name = Arcade Master
ach.level_40.desc = Reach player level forty.
ach.level_40.flavour = Level forty, and even the gold medals bend a little for you now.
ach.level_40.name = Golden Years
ach.level_5.desc = Reach player level five.
ach.level_5.flavour = Level five. The bar filled up faster than you expected, and it will slow down from here -- but you are properly on your way now.
ach.level_5.name = Getting Started
ach.level_50.desc = Reach player level fifty.
ach.level_50.flavour = Level fifty. There is a version of you in this save file that the machines will be telling stories about.
ach.level_50.name = Legend Of The Lobby
ach.lifetime10k.desc = Earn ten thousand coins across your career.
ach.lifetime10k.flavour = Ten thousand coins. If this place had a wall of fame, you would be the wall.
ach.lifetime10k.name = Ten Thousand
ach.lighthouse_10.desc = Guide ten ships in.
ach.lighthouse_10.flavour = Ten ships brought safely past. None of them will ever know it was you.
ach.lighthouse_10.name = Keeper Of The Light
ach.lights_10.desc = Clear ten boards in Lights Out.
ach.lights_10.flavour = Every last light switched off, ten times over.
ach.lights_10.name = Lights Out
ach.lockpick_400.desc = Score 400 in Lock Picker.
ach.lockpick_400.flavour = Every pin set to its faint little click.
ach.lockpick_400.name = Light Fingers
ach.locksmith_5.desc = Open five locks.
ach.locksmith_5.flavour = Five locks, every pin set by the change in the scrape. That is a real skill and it belongs to your fingers now.
ach.locksmith_5.name = Feels The Click
ach.long_single.desc = Play a single game for over five minutes.
ach.long_single.flavour = Five minutes on one run without dying. That is not luck any more.
ach.long_single.name = One Sitting
ach.long_survivor.desc = Survive three minutes in one game.
ach.long_survivor.flavour = Three minutes in a single run, with everything getting quicker around you the whole time.
ach.long_survivor.name = Still Standing
ach.longjump_8m.desc = Jump eight metres in the Long Jump.
ach.longjump_8m.flavour = Full speed, right on the board, and a long way into the sand.
ach.longjump_8m.name = Eight Metres
ach.lose_streak.desc = Lose five games in a row.
ach.lose_streak.flavour = Five straight losses. It happens. Put on the jukebox for a minute and let your ears reset.
ach.lose_streak.name = Rough Night
ach.losses_10.desc = Lose ten times.
ach.losses_10.flavour = Ten losses. Every one of them taught you something about how the sound moves, whether you noticed or not.
ach.losses_10.name = Practice
ach.losses_100.desc = Lose a hundred times.
ach.losses_100.flavour = A hundred losses and you are still here. That is not stubbornness. That is the whole point.
ach.losses_100.name = Persistence
ach.loudness_15.desc = Get fifteen right in Loudest Wins.
ach.loudness_15.flavour = Fifteen correct on differences that shrink to a few percent. Most people cannot do that with a meter.
ach.loudness_15.name = Fine Ear For Volume
ach.maketen_400.desc = Score 400 in Make Ten.
ach.maketen_400.flavour = Every number found its partner, right up to a hundred.
ach.maketen_400.name = Perfect Pairs
ach.manual_devotee.desc = Ask for the instructions fifty times.
ach.manual_devotee.flavour = Fifty readings of the instructions. Either these games are harder than we thought, or you simply enjoy the sound of the rules.
ach.manual_devotee.name = Bedtime Reading
ach.marathon.desc = Spend three hours in the arcade.
ach.marathon.flavour = Three hours. Somewhere out there the afternoon has gone by and you have not noticed.
ach.marathon.name = Marathon
ach.marathon_day.desc = Spend twenty hours in the arcade.
ach.marathon_day.flavour = Twenty hours. You do not visit this place. You live here.
ach.marathon_day.name = Resident
ach.marathon_five.desc = Complete the Marathon five times.
ach.marathon_five.flavour = Five marathons, five single lives, five sets of nerves held together to the end.
ach.marathon_five.name = Five Marathons
ach.marathon_mode.desc = Clear Marathon Mode on one life.
ach.marathon_mode.flavour = Five games. One life. No second chances anywhere in the chain.
ach.marathon_mode.name = Iron Ears
ach.marathon_time.desc = Spend five hours in the arcade.
ach.marathon_time.flavour = Five hours in this building. Drink some water. Then come back.
ach.marathon_time.name = Long Session
ach.marble_5.desc = Reach stage five in Marble Run.
ach.marble_5.flavour = Five stages of shutters timed to the beat of their own opening.
ach.marble_5.name = Steady Table
ach.mathladder_500.desc = Score 500 in Math Ladder.
ach.mathladder_500.flavour = Rung after rung, and the answers only got quicker.
ach.mathladder_500.name = Top Rung
ach.mathstar_20.desc = Score 12,000 in Math Star, about twenty sums right.
ach.mathstar_20.flavour = Twenty right, on the beat, out loud. Mental arithmetic under pressure is a real skill and you have it.
ach.mathstar_20.name = Quick Sums
ach.maze_15.desc = Score 15 in the Maze.
ach.maze_15.flavour = Every wall remembered, every turn right. The exit was never really lost.
ach.maze_15.name = Way Out
ach.maze_escape.desc = Escape a maze without hitting a single wall.
ach.maze_escape.flavour = Out of the maze without touching one wall. You built the whole map in your head from echoes.
ach.maze_escape.name = Cartographer
ach.medal_100.desc = Collect a hundred medals in all, counting each bronze, silver and gold.
ach.medal_100.flavour = A hundred trips to the podium.
ach.medal_100.name = Medal Collector
ach.medal_first.desc = Win your first medal in any cabinet.
ach.medal_first.flavour = Bronze today. The other two are waiting.
ach.medal_first.name = On The Podium
ach.medal_gold_1.desc = Win a gold medal.
ach.medal_gold_1.flavour = Three and a half times par. The cabinet bows.
ach.medal_gold_1.name = Gold Standard
ach.medal_gold_10.desc = Win gold medals in ten cabinets.
ach.medal_gold_10.flavour = Ten cabinets, ten golds, and a shelf getting heavy.
ach.medal_gold_10.name = Gilded
ach.medal_gold_50.desc = Win gold medals in fifty cabinets.
ach.medal_gold_50.flavour = Fifty golds. There is no such thing as a weak world for you.
ach.medal_gold_50.name = Gold Rush
ach.memory_12.desc = Reach a sequence of twelve in Memory Maestro.
ach.memory_12.flavour = Twelve notes held in your head at once. Most people fall apart at seven.
ach.memory_12.name = Elephant
ach.merge_top.desc = Reach a high tone in Ball Merge.
ach.merge_top.flavour = Tones stacking into tones. That column took real foresight.
ach.merge_top.name = Big Merge
ach.meteors_200.desc = Score 200 in Meteor Shower.
ach.meteors_200.flavour = Rocks all around, and stars in your pockets.
ach.meteors_200.name = Under The Shower
ach.minesweeper_60.desc = Score 60 in Minesweeper.
ach.minesweeper_60.flavour = Not one wrong dig where it counted. The field is safe to walk.
ach.minesweeper_60.name = Clear Ground
ach.mirror_ten.desc = Win ten games in Mirror mode.
ach.mirror_ten.flavour = Ten wins with the world reversed. You have two maps of this place now.
ach.mirror_ten.name = Ambidextrous
ach.mirror_win.desc = Win a game in Mirror mode.
ach.mirror_win.flavour = Left and right swapped, and you still won. Everything you knew about that cabinet had to be relearned backwards.
ach.mirror_win.name = Through The Looking Glass
ach.mirrorimage_300.desc = Score 300 in Mirror Image.
ach.mirrorimage_300.flavour = Left, right, exactly as far. The mirror could not have done better.
ach.mirrorimage_300.name = Perfect Reflection
ach.mirrors_15.desc = Find fifteen real voices in the Hall of Mirrors.
ach.mirrors_15.flavour = Fifteen. The reflections stopped fooling you a while ago.
ach.mirrors_15.name = Sees Through It
ach.mirrors_5.desc = Find five real voices in the Hall of Mirrors.
ach.mirrors_5.flavour = Five times you walked past a convincing reflection and went to the real thing instead.
ach.mirrors_5.name = Not Fooled
ach.missile_save.desc = Score four hundred in Missile Command.
ach.missile_save.flavour = The cities are still standing, and that was entirely your doing.
ach.missile_save.name = City Saver
ach.missing_400.desc = Score 400 in Missing Number.
ach.missing_400.flavour = Every gap in every sum filled in, and fast.
ach.missing_400.name = Nothing Missing
ach.mission_50.desc = Complete fifty daily missions.
ach.mission_50.flavour = Fifty goals, set by the arcade and met by you.
ach.mission_50.name = Mission Control
ach.mission_day.desc = Complete all three daily missions in one day.
ach.mission_day.flavour = Every goal for the day, ticked off.
ach.mission_day.name = Full Day's Work
ach.mission_first.desc = Complete a daily mission.
ach.mission_first.flavour = One goal down. Two to go, and a bonus behind them.
ach.mission_first.name = On A Mission
ach.mission_week.desc = Complete all three daily missions seven days in a row.
ach.mission_week.flavour = A week without missing a single goal.
ach.mission_week.name = Seven Days Of Missions
ach.nail_100.desc = Score 100 in The Nail.
ach.nail_100.flavour = Flush, again and again. Your rival is counting bent nails.
ach.nail_100.name = Hit It On The Head
ach.near_miss_10.desc = Fall just short of a medal ten times.
ach.near_miss_10.flavour = Ten times within a whisker. The eleventh is the one.
ach.near_miss_10.name = So Close
ach.neverstop_500.desc = Run five hundred metres in Never Stop.
ach.neverstop_500.flavour = Five hundred metres with the floor coming apart behind you.
ach.neverstop_500.name = Never Stopped
ach.night_1.desc = Host a Party Night.
ach.night_1.flavour = Friends round, controller passed, and a winner crowned.
ach.night_1.name = Party Host
ach.night_4.desc = Host a Party Night for four players.
ach.night_4.flavour = Four names on the board and nobody willing to lose.
ach.night_4.name = Four At The Table
ach.night_all.desc = Play every Night Shift cabinet.
ach.night_all.flavour = Every job on the rota. Somebody should give you a set of keys.
ach.night_all.name = The Whole Rota
ach.night_first.desc = Play a game in The Night Shift.
ach.night_first.flavour = The Night Shift is not about reflexes. It is about keeping a system running while it does its best to get away from you.
ach.night_first.name = Clocking On
ach.night_full.desc = Play ten different Night Shift cabinets.
ach.night_full.flavour = Ten jobs on the night shift. You have run a switchboard, a lighthouse and a warehouse, and none of them fell over.
ach.night_full.name = Night Shift Regular
ach.night_owl.desc = Play after midnight.
ach.night_owl.flavour = After midnight. The machines sound different at this hour, and it is not your imagination. It is quieter, so you hear more.
ach.night_owl.name = Night Owl
ach.nightbus_20.desc = Call twenty stops correctly.
ach.nightbus_20.flavour = Twenty stops called on time. Nobody had to walk back.
ach.nightbus_20.name = Every Stop
ach.ninety_five.desc = Play ninety-five different games.
ach.ninety_five.flavour = Ninety-five cabinets, and the building still has more. You are nearly through it.
ach.ninety_five.name = Ninety-Five Cabinets
ach.no_continue.desc = Win a game without spending a continue.
ach.no_continue.flavour = No continue, no second chance, no need for either.
ach.no_continue.name = No Safety Net
ach.no_music.desc = Win a game with the music turned all the way down.
ach.no_music.flavour = No soundtrack, nothing but the game's own sounds. That is the sound design naked, and you beat it.
ach.no_music.name = Pure Signal
ach.no_quit.desc = Finish fifty games without quitting early.
ach.no_quit.flavour = Fifty games played all the way to the end, win or lose. Finishing is its own discipline.
ach.no_quit.name = Finisher
ach.notehold_10.desc = Match ten note lengths.
ach.notehold_10.flavour = Ten durations reproduced from feel alone, with nothing counting for you.
ach.notehold_10.name = Internal Clock
ach.numline_300.desc = Score 300 in Number Line.
ach.numline_300.flavour = A tone on the line, and you could name its number to within a whisker.
ach.numline_300.name = On The Line
ach.obsessed.desc = Play the same game fifty times.
ach.obsessed.flavour = Fifty runs at the same machine. Whatever it is doing to you, it is working.
ach.obsessed.name = Obsessed
ach.oddeven_15.desc = Get fifteen right in Odd or Even.
ach.oddeven_15.flavour = Fifteen correct calls on counts too fast to really count. You are not counting any more, you are feeling it.
ach.oddeven_15.name = Parity Expert
ach.oddnum_300.desc = Score 300 in Odd Number Out.
ach.oddnum_300.flavour = Every list had one number out of line, and you found it every time.
ach.oddnum_300.name = Rule Breaker
ach.oddone_20.desc = Get twenty right in Odd One Out.
ach.oddone_20.flavour = Twenty sounds picked out of their crowd.
ach.oddone_20.name = Odd One Out
ach.one_more_game.desc = Be asked if you want to quit, and answer no.
ach.one_more_game.flavour = The door was right there. The cabinets called you back.
ach.one_more_game.name = Just One More
ach.one_point.desc = Finish a game with exactly one point.
ach.one_point.flavour = Exactly one point. Not nothing. Technically not nothing.
ach.one_point.name = By A Whisker
ach.one_sitting.desc = Play for two hours without leaving.
ach.one_sitting.flavour = Two hours in one visit. Stretch. Drink something.
ach.one_sitting.name = One Long Sitting
ach.options_visit.desc = Open the options.
ach.options_visit.flavour = Into the settings. Everything in there is meant to be moved. It is your arcade.
ach.options_visit.name = Tinkerer
ach.orchestra_15.desc = Identify fifteen instruments.
ach.orchestra_15.flavour = Fifteen instruments named. You are hearing timbre now, not just pitch.
ach.orchestra_15.name = Section Leader
ach.pairs_300.desc = Score 300 in Sound Pairs.
ach.pairs_300.flavour = Every card you turned, you remembered. The table ran out before you did.
ach.pairs_300.name = Perfect Recall
ach.pairs_perfect.desc = Clear a Sound Pairs board without a single wrong match.
ach.pairs_perfect.flavour = Not one wrong pair. You remembered every tone the first time you heard it.
ach.pairs_perfect.name = Photographic
ach.paper_clean.desc = Finish a Paper Round without coming off your bike.
ach.paper_clean.flavour = Thirty houses, every pothole hopped.
ach.paper_clean.name = Every Step On The Street
ach.parachute_land.desc = Collect ten prizes in one descent.
ach.parachute_land.flavour = Ten prizes gathered on the way down, and you still had time to dodge what was coming at you.
ach.parachute_land.name = Soft Landing
ach.party_animal.desc = Finish a full Party Mode run.
ach.party_animal.flavour = Twelve rounds, three lives, one survivor. You.
ach.party_animal.name = Party Animal
ach.party_flawless.desc = Clear Party Mode without losing a life.
ach.party_flawless.flavour = Twelve rounds and not one life lost. That is the single hardest thing in this arcade and you made it sound easy.
ach.party_flawless.name = Life Of The Party
ach.paused_fifty.desc = Pause fifty times.
ach.paused_fifty.flavour = Fifty pauses. Long sessions are made of short ones.
ach.paused_fifty.name = Chapter Breaks
ach.paused_first.desc = Pause a game.
ach.paused_first.flavour = Everything stopped and waited for you. It will do that as often as you need.
ach.paused_first.name = Take Five
ach.penalty_saves.desc = Save twenty-five penalties in Penalty Shootout, in all.
ach.penalty_saves.flavour = Twenty-five kicks that should have gone in, and did not.
ach.penalty_saves.name = Safe Hands
ach.perfectionist.desc = Set twenty personal bests.
ach.perfectionist.flavour = Twenty personal bests. Each one was a number that looked unreachable right up until it wasn't.
ach.perfectionist.name = Perfectionist
ach.pinball_1000.desc = Score a thousand in Pinball.
ach.pinball_1000.flavour = A thousand points on a table you have never seen.
ach.pinball_1000.name = Silver Ball
ach.pinball_5000.desc = Score five thousand in Pinball.
ach.pinball_5000.flavour = Five thousand on a table you cannot see. Pure feel and memory.
ach.pinball_5000.name = Table Master
ach.pingpong_match.desc = Win a match of Table Tennis.
ach.pingpong_match.flavour = Two games taken, every bounce heard on the way.
ach.pingpong_match.name = Ping And Pong
ach.pingpong_rally.desc = Keep a Table Tennis rally going for twenty shots of yours.
ach.pingpong_rally.flavour = Back and forth, back and forth, and neither of you would give in.
ach.pingpong_rally.name = Back And Forth
ach.pitch_master.desc = Get fifteen right in Pitch Perfect.
ach.pitch_master.flavour = Fifteen correct, with the gap closing every time. That is a trained ear, and you trained it here.
ach.pitch_master.name = Golden Ears
ach.pitchsort_300.desc = Score 300 in Pitch Sort.
ach.pitchsort_300.flavour = Low on the left, high on the right, and not a single tone out of place.
ach.pitchsort_300.name = Perfect Scale
ach.plays_thousand.desc = Play a thousand games.
ach.plays_thousand.flavour = One thousand games. This is not a number you set out to reach. It is one you look up and discover you have passed.
ach.plays_thousand.name = A Thousand Games Deep
ach.plugged_in.desc = Play a game with a game controller. A bonus: not needed for Nothing Left To Earn.
ach.plugged_in.flavour = Thumbs on the sticks, and the arcade in your hands. Suggested by kody.
ach.plugged_in.name = Plugged In
ach.plush_1.desc = Win a plush prize at the Ticket Booth.
ach.plush_1.flavour = Your first prize, and it has a tune of its own.
ach.plush_1.name = Prize Winner
ach.plush_12.desc = Win twelve plush prizes.
ach.plush_12.flavour = Half the booth, lined up on your shelf.
ach.plush_12.name = Stuffed Shelf
ach.plush_all.desc = Win every prize at the Ticket Booth, crown included.
ach.plush_all.flavour = The attendant has nothing left to give you.
ach.plush_all.name = Cleaned Out The Booth
ach.poly_200.desc = Score 200 in Polyrhythm.
ach.poly_200.flavour = One hand in threes, the other in twos, and neither lost.
ach.poly_200.name = Three Against Two
ach.pong_20.desc = Reach twenty rallies in Pong.
ach.pong_20.flavour = Twenty returns in one rally. Neither of you would give it up.
ach.pong_20.name = Long Rally
ach.pong_40.desc = Reach forty returns in one Pong rally.
ach.pong_40.flavour = Forty returns without a miss. Neither of you was going to blink.
ach.pong_40.name = Endless Rally
ach.pool_250.desc = Score 250 in Pool.
ach.pool_250.flavour = A whole rack cut into the pockets, the angles all by ear.
ach.pool_250.name = Clean Table
ach.pool_combo.desc = Pot two or more balls with one shot in Pool.
ach.pool_combo.flavour = One ball knocked the other, and both of them dropped.
ach.pool_combo.name = Two In One
ach.practice_makes.desc = Play five games in the practice room.
ach.practice_makes.flavour = No score, no lives, no pressure. This is where the actual learning happens.
ach.practice_makes.name = Practice Room
ach.practice_used.desc = Use the practice room.
ach.practice_used.flavour = No score, no lives, no stakes. Just you and the sound, getting the feel of it.
ach.practice_used.name = Warm-Up
ach.press_200.desc = Print two hundred pages without a jam ending the run.
ach.press_200.flavour = Two hundred pages. You heard every stumble before it became a jam.
ach.press_200.name = Kept The Line Running
ach.prime_500.desc = Score 500 in Prime Factor.
ach.prime_500.flavour = Divisible by what? You knew before it finished asking.
ach.prime_500.name = Sieve Of The Arcade
ach.primes_150.desc = Score 150 in Prime Time.
ach.primes_150.flavour = Two, three, five, seven, eleven... you caught every one of them.
ach.primes_150.name = Prime Suspect
ach.prizes_fifty.desc = Open fifty prize doors in the Rewards Hall.
ach.prizes_fifty.flavour = Fifty doors opened. You have heard every jingle the hall has, and still you come back for one more.
ach.prizes_fifty.name = Door Prize Regular
ach.profile_set.desc = Give the arcade your name and choose an avatar.
ach.profile_set.flavour = Now the machines know who to cheer for.
ach.profile_set.name = That's Me
ach.pusher_gold.desc = Push a golden coin over the edge of the Coin Pusher.
ach.pusher_gold.flavour = It teetered, it tipped, it fell. Fifteen tickets.
ach.pusher_gold.name = Golden Coin
ach.quickdraw_300.desc = Score 300 in Quick Draw.
ach.quickdraw_300.flavour = The signal had barely started and you had already fired.
ach.quickdraw_300.name = Fastest Ear In Town
ach.quickdraw_fast.desc = React in under 200 milliseconds in Quick Draw.
ach.quickdraw_fast.flavour = Under two hundred milliseconds. That is faster than most people can decide to move.
ach.quickdraw_fast.name = Lightning
ach.quiet_hours.desc = Play for an hour after midnight.
ach.quiet_hours.flavour = A full hour after midnight. The arcade does sound different when the world is quiet, and you have noticed.
ach.quiet_hours.name = Small Hours
ach.quiet_win.desc = Win a game with both music and speech off.
ach.quiet_win.flavour = No music, no narration. Only the sounds the game itself makes, which turns out to be enough.
ach.quiet_win.name = Won In Silence
ach.racer_800.desc = Score 800 in Racer.
ach.racer_800.flavour = The engine sang, the road bent, and you never left the tarmac.
ach.racer_800.name = Racing Line
ach.racer_lap.desc = Finish a Sound Racer track under forty five seconds.
ach.racer_lap.flavour = Under forty five seconds, steering by engine note and gravel.
ach.racer_lap.name = Speed Demon
ach.radio_no_dead_air.desc = Finish a Night Radio shift without a second of dead air.
ach.radio_no_dead_air.flavour = Fifteen songs, and the station never went quiet.
ach.radio_no_dead_air.name = Smooth Operator
ach.rage_hard.desc = Rage quit five different games.
ach.rage_hard.flavour = Five different cabinets have now driven you off. Statistically, one of them must be the problem, and statistically, it is not them.
ach.rage_hard.name = Full Tilt
ach.rage_quit.desc = Quit the same game three times in a row.
ach.rage_quit.flavour = Three times you started that cabinet, and three times you walked away. The machine is not going to apologise, but it has noticed.
ach.rage_quit.name = Rage Quit
ach.railroad_150.desc = Score 150 in Railroad.
ach.railroad_150.flavour = Every switch followed in your head. The wagons all came home.
ach.railroad_150.name = Signalman
ach.ramp_two.desc = Survive long enough for a game to reach double speed.
ach.ramp_two.flavour = You stayed in long enough that the cabinet ran out of ways to speed up. It is going as fast as it goes now.
ach.ramp_two.name = Kept Up
ach.rank_fifty_s.desc = Earn fifty S ranks.
ach.rank_fifty_s.flavour = Fifty personal records shattered. Every one of them was a wall you decided was a door.
ach.rank_fifty_s.name = The Ceiling Is A Suggestion
ach.rank_first_s.desc = Earn an S rank on any game.
ach.rank_first_s.flavour = An S rank -- a new personal best on a cabinet you had already beaten. The machine has nothing left to teach you on that one for now.
ach.rank_first_s.name = Perfect Run
ach.rank_ten_s.desc = Earn ten S ranks.
ach.rank_ten_s.flavour = Ten S ranks. You do not just play these games, you keep beating yourself at them.
ach.rank_ten_s.name = Ten Times Perfect
ach.read_all_achievements.desc = Scroll through the entire achievement list in one go.
ach.read_all_achievements.flavour = You read the whole list. All of it. Including this one, which you have just now earned by doing so.
ach.read_all_achievements.name = Completionist Reader
ach.read_the_manual.desc = Press F1 for the instructions.
ach.read_the_manual.flavour = You pressed F1 and actually listened to the instructions. You would be astonished how rare that is.
ach.read_the_manual.name = Read The Manual
ach.regular.desc = Play twenty five games in total.
ach.regular.flavour = Twenty five games. The staff, if there were any, would know your order by now.
ach.regular.name = Regular Customer
ach.repeat_that.desc = Ask for the last thing to be repeated.
ach.repeat_that.flavour = Say again. Sometimes the announcement goes past you, and there is no rule against asking twice.
ach.repeat_that.name = Say Again
ach.replay_pitch.desc = Replay a pair of tones in Pitch Perfect.
ach.replay_pitch.flavour = You asked to hear it again rather than guessing. Comparing two tones from memory is a much harder task than comparing them freshly, and there is no prize for making it harder.
ach.replay_pitch.name = Listen Again
ach.rescue_10.desc = Rescue ten survivors in one run.
ach.rescue_10.flavour = Ten people found in the dark by the sound of their voices.
ach.rescue_10.name = Search And Rescue
ach.reset_profile.desc = Erase your progress and start again.
ach.reset_profile.flavour = Everything wiped, on purpose. There is a particular courage in choosing to hear it all for the first time again.
ach.reset_profile.name = Clean Slate
ach.retry_50.desc = Use Instant Retry fifty times.
ach.retry_50.flavour = Fifty immediate restarts. You do not walk away from a bad run, you go straight back in.
ach.retry_50.name = Once More
ach.rhythm_full.desc = Play ten different Rhythm Row cabinets.
ach.rhythm_full.flavour = Ten cabinets on the Row. Your sense of time has had a proper workout.
ach.rhythm_full.name = Rhythm Row Regular
ach.rich.desc = Hold five hundred coins at once.
ach.rich.flavour = Five hundred coins in your pocket, jingling. Go and spend some. They do not gain interest.
ach.rich.name = Pocket Full Of Quarters
ach.rich2.desc = Hold two thousand coins at once.
ach.rich2.flavour = Two thousand coins, unspent. There is a whole wall of prizes over there and you are hoarding tokens like a dragon.
ach.rich2.name = Coin Vault
ach.royal_flush.desc = Draw a royal flush at Video Poker.
ach.royal_flush.flavour = Ten to the ace, all one suit. It pays two hundred and fifty times.
ach.royal_flush.name = Royal Flush
ach.running_300.desc = Score 300 in Running Total.
ach.running_300.flavour = Add this, take away that, and the total never slipped your mind.
ach.running_300.name = Head For Figures
ach.sale_250.desc = Score 250 in Sale Price.
ach.sale_250.flavour = Every discount worked out before the till could ring it up.
ach.sale_250.name = Bargain Hunter
ach.sampler.desc = Play five different games.
ach.sampler.flavour = Five different cabinets. You are wandering the room rather than standing at one machine, which is exactly how an arcade is meant to be used.
ach.sampler.name = Sampler
ach.school_first.desc = Play a game's sounds from its instructions screen.
ach.school_first.flavour = You learned the cues before the clock started. That is not caution, that is the fastest way in.
ach.school_first.name = Listen First
ach.school_ten.desc = Preview sounds fifty times.
ach.school_ten.flavour = Fifty times you stopped to learn what a noise meant before letting it come at you. It shows.
ach.school_ten.name = Study Hall
ach.scores_check.desc = Check the high score table.
ach.scores_check.flavour = Checking the numbers. There is a specific pleasure in a record you set yourself and then have to beat yourself.
ach.scores_check.name = Bookkeeper
ach.second_run.desc = Start the arcade a second time.
ach.second_run.flavour = You came back. That is genuinely the hardest achievement in the whole list, and you have already got it.
ach.second_run.name = You Came Back
ach.sequence_300.desc = Score 300 in Sequence Finder.
ach.sequence_300.flavour = Doubling, squaring, adding the two before. Nothing got past you.
ach.sequence_300.name = Pattern Spotter
ach.set_1.desc = Complete a set of plush prizes.
ach.set_1.flavour = Eight prizes, one theme, a gem for your trouble.
ach.set_1.name = Set Collector
ach.set_all.desc = Complete all five sets of plush prizes.
ach.set_all.flavour = Woodland, Ocean, Wild, Fantasy and Arcade, every shelf full.
ach.set_all.name = Every Set
ach.seven_days.desc = Play on seven consecutive days.
ach.seven_days.flavour = A week without missing a day. Habits are built exactly like this.
ach.seven_days.name = Seven Days Running
ach.seven_worlds.desc = Play a game in seven different worlds.
ach.seven_worlds.flavour = Seven worlds visited. There is only one door left that you have not opened.
ach.seven_worlds.name = Seven Worlds
ach.seventy_five.desc = Play seventy-five different games.
ach.seventy_five.flavour = Seventy-five. The rooms you have not visited are getting hard to find.
ach.seventy_five.name = Seventy Five
ach.shop_haunt.desc = Visit the prize counter twenty times.
ach.shop_haunt.flavour = Twenty trips to the counter. Half of them just to look. We know.
ach.shop_haunt.name = Counter Regular
ach.signal_all.desc = Decode all eight signals in one round of Signal Hunt.
ach.signal_all.flavour = Eight messages from the dark, and you read every one.
ach.signal_all.name = We Are Not Alone
ach.silent_music_ten.desc = Win ten games with the music turned off.
ach.silent_music_ten.flavour = Ten wins in silence but for the sound design itself. You hear things in these games most players drown out.
ach.silent_music_ten.name = Nothing But The Game
ach.silent_run.desc = Finish a game with speech switched off.
ach.silent_run.flavour = No speech, no announcements, no help. Just the sound design and you. That is the game as it was designed.
ach.silent_run.name = By Ear Only
ach.simon_says.desc = Score thirty in Whack-a-Wave.
ach.simon_says.flavour = Thirty hits and not one bomb. Restraint is half of that game.
ach.simon_says.name = Follow The Leader
ach.six_worlds.desc = Play a game in all {worlds} worlds.
ach.six_worlds.flavour = {worlds} worlds, every one of them visited. You have walked the entire building now, and it is bigger than it sounded from the door.
ach.six_worlds.name = The Whole Building
ach.skeeball_500.desc = Score 500 in a game of Skee-Ball.
ach.skeeball_500.flavour = Rolled up the lane and into the rings, again and again.
ach.skeeball_500.name = Top Of The Lane
ach.skeet_perfect.desc = Break every clay in a round of Skeet Shooting.
ach.skeet_perfect.flavour = Not one clay reached the grass.
ach.skeet_perfect.name = Twenty-Five Straight
ach.skip_used.desc = Use a Round Skip.
ach.skip_used.flavour = One losing round waved away. That is what you bought it for.
ach.skip_used.name = Get Out Of Jail
ach.slalom_clean.desc = Ski all thirty gates of Slalom without missing one.
ach.slalom_clean.flavour = Thirty flags, and you brushed past every one of them.
ach.slalom_clean.name = Every Gate
ach.slide_5.desc = Solve five puzzles in Tile Slide.
ach.slide_5.flavour = One through eight, back in order by ear alone.
ach.slide_5.name = Tile Shuffler
ach.slow_win.desc = Win a game with the speed dial below eighty percent.
ach.slow_win.flavour = Slowed right down and played properly. Speed is a difficulty setting, not a measure of worth.
ach.slow_win.name = Taken Slowly
ach.snake_20.desc = Eat twenty apples in Snake.
ach.snake_20.flavour = Twenty apples, and the tail behind you is now the real danger.
ach.snake_20.name = Long Snake
ach.snake_40.desc = Eat forty apples in Snake.
ach.snake_40.flavour = Forty apples. The board is mostly you now, and every turn is a decision about your own body.
ach.snake_40.name = Long Tail
ach.sniper_1500.desc = Score 1,500 in Echo Sniper.
ach.sniper_1500.flavour = You found them by their echoes alone. The dark has nowhere left to hide.
ach.sniper_1500.name = Sound Sniper
ach.sniper_20.desc = Hit twenty targets in one round of Echo Sniper.
ach.sniper_20.flavour = Twenty targets found by sound alone. You are not guessing. You are measuring.
ach.sniper_20.name = Dead Ear
ach.sokoban_15.desc = Solve fifteen Warehouse Shift levels.
ach.sokoban_15.flavour = Fifteen. You are holding an entire floor plan in your head with no picture of it anywhere.
ach.sokoban_15.name = Warehouse Manager
ach.sokoban_30.desc = Solve thirty Warehouse Shift stages.
ach.sokoban_30.flavour = Thirty warehouses. You hold a floor plan in your head that has never been drawn anywhere.
ach.sokoban_30.name = Warehouse Chief
ach.sokoban_5.desc = Solve five Warehouse Shift levels.
ach.sokoban_5.flavour = Five warehouses cleared. Crates only go forward, so every one of those was thought through before it was pushed.
ach.sokoban_5.name = Warehouse Hand
ach.sorting_50.desc = Sort fifty parcels.
ach.sorting_50.flavour = Fifty parcels, three bins, one chime each. The belt never once got ahead of you.
ach.sorting_50.name = Sorted
ach.soundorder_5.desc = Reach round five of Sound Order.
ach.soundorder_5.flavour = Eight sounds, each with a number, all held at once. Most people manage four.
ach.soundorder_5.name = Filing System
ach.space_full.desc = Play ten different Deep Space cabinets.
ach.space_full.flavour = Ten cabinets out in the dark, and nothing out there holds still.
ach.space_full.name = Deep Space Regular
ach.speed_dial_used.desc = Change the speed dial.
ach.speed_dial_used.flavour = You set the speed yourself. There is no correct setting, only the one that lets you hear what is happening.
ach.speed_dial_used.name = Your Own Pace
ach.spend_20000.desc = Spend twenty thousand coins.
ach.spend_20000.flavour = Twenty thousand. The prize counter has seen more of you than the cabinets have.
ach.spend_20000.name = The Vault Is Empty
ach.spend_5000.desc = Spend five thousand coins.
ach.spend_5000.flavour = Five thousand coins across the counter. Every one of them earned by listening.
ach.spend_5000.name = Big Spender
ach.spotsound_400.desc = Score 400 in Spot The Sound.
ach.spotsound_400.flavour = A crowd of lookalikes, and you picked out the one you were given.
ach.spotsound_400.name = Needle In A Haystack
ach.sprint_10s.desc = Run the 100 metres in under ten seconds.
ach.sprint_10s.flavour = Left, right, left, right, and the clock stopped in single figures.
ach.sprint_10s.name = Under Ten
ach.star_classic.desc = Earn three stars in Classic Corner.
ach.star_classic.flavour = Three stars in the Corner. Those cabinets are older than the idea of playing them by ear.
ach.star_classic.name = Classic Corner Star
ach.star_first.desc = Earn your first star on a World Tour.
ach.star_first.flavour = Your first star. There are a lot more of them, and they get considerably less polite.
ach.star_first.name = First Star
ach.star_math.desc = Earn three stars in Number Hall.
ach.star_math.flavour = Three stars in the Hall, and not a sum left standing.
ach.star_math.name = Number Hall Star
ach.star_neon.desc = Earn three stars in Neon Alley.
ach.star_neon.flavour = Three stars in the Alley. Fast hands, faster ears.
ach.star_neon.name = Neon Alley Star
ach.star_puzzle.desc = Earn three stars in Puzzle Parlour.
ach.star_puzzle.flavour = Three stars in the Parlour, where nothing moves until you move it.
ach.star_puzzle.name = Puzzle Parlour Star
ach.star_rhythm.desc = Earn three stars in Rhythm Row.
ach.star_rhythm.flavour = Three stars on the Row. Your sense of time is sharpening.
ach.star_rhythm.name = Rhythm Row Star
ach.star_space.desc = Earn three stars in Deep Space.
ach.star_space.flavour = Three stars out in Deep Space. Nothing out there is holding still.
ach.star_space.name = Deep Space Star
ach.star_thirty.desc = Earn thirty stars in total.
ach.star_thirty.flavour = Thirty stars. Enough to make a shape, if anyone were looking down.
ach.star_thirty.name = Constellation
ach.statues_1200.desc = Score 1,200 in Statues.
ach.statues_1200.flavour = Walk, walk, walk, stop. The flash never caught you.
ach.statues_1200.name = Frozen In Time
ach.status_checker.desc = Ask for your status mid-game with F2.
ach.status_checker.flavour = You checked your own score without pausing. Small habit, big difference.
ach.status_checker.name = Situational Awareness
ach.sticks_perfect.desc = Win five stick games in a row.
ach.sticks_perfect.flavour = Five straight. You have worked out the pattern, and the machine has nothing left to teach you about this one.
ach.sticks_perfect.name = Solved It
ach.sticks_win.desc = Win ten rounds of the stick game.
ach.sticks_win.flavour = Ten wins. You found the pattern: leave a multiple of four behind and the game plays itself.
ach.sticks_win.name = Nim Master
ach.still = {n} still to discover
ach.stilts_100.desc = Take a hundred paces on stilts.
ach.stilts_100.flavour = A hundred paces in perfect alternation. That is a walk, not a stunt.
ach.stilts_100.name = Long Legs
ach.streak_hot.desc = Reach the top hit-streak multiplier in a game.
ach.streak_hot.flavour = Four times multiplier. Everything you touched turned to points for a while there. That is the feeling the whole arcade is chasing.
ach.streak_hot.name = On Fire
ach.stubborn.desc = Play the same game twenty times.
ach.stubborn.flavour = Twenty runs at one cabinet. You are not trying to win any more. You are trying to understand it.
ach.stubborn.name = Stubborn
ach.sudoku_10.desc = Solve ten grids in Tone Sudoku.
ach.sudoku_10.flavour = Every row, column and box in tune.
ach.sudoku_10.name = Grid Master
ach.sundial_150.desc = Score 150 in Sundial.
ach.sundial_150.flavour = Dawn on the right, dusk on the left, and you never lost track of the hour.
ach.sundial_150.name = High Noon
ach.super_rare.desc = Find a super rare figure in a capsule.
ach.super_rare.flavour = One in twenty, and this one was yours.
ach.super_rare.name = Super Rare
ach.swamp_cross.desc = Cross the swamp ten times.
ach.swamp_cross.flavour = Ten crossings. You are holding a route in your head that you have never once seen.
ach.swamp_cross.name = Sure Footing
ach.swamp_first.desc = Cross the swamp once.
ach.swamp_first.flavour = Across. Every step of that route is now in your head and nowhere else.
ach.swamp_first.name = First Crossing
ach.swim_win.desc = Beat your rival in Swimming.
ach.swim_win.flavour = Two lengths, every breath on time, and a touch ahead at the wall.
ach.swim_win.name = Gold Medal
ach.switchboard_20.desc = Connect twenty calls.
ach.switchboard_20.flavour = Twenty calls put through, each one matched by ear against a board full of near-identical sockets.
ach.switchboard_20.name = Operator
ach.syncopate_30.desc = Land thirty off-beats.
ach.syncopate_30.flavour = Thirty presses in the gaps between beats. Playing on the beat is easy; playing between them is the whole of groove.
ach.syncopate_30.name = In The Cracks
ach.tables_300.desc = Score 300 in Times Tables.
ach.tables_300.flavour = Seven eights? Before the question had even finished.
ach.tables_300.name = Times Table Champion
ach.tamper_seen.desc = Have a modified save file rejected.
ach.tamper_seen.flavour = Something tried to rewrite your progress and the game noticed. No harm done, and nothing was lost. But we both saw it.
ach.tamper_seen.name = Nice Try
ach.tamper_ten.desc = Have ten modified saves rejected.
ach.tamper_ten.flavour = Ten attempts. Whatever you are trying, the save file has noticed all of them.
ach.tamper_ten.name = Persistent
ach.target_120.desc = Score 120 in Target Number.
ach.target_120.flavour = Plus, times, minus, and the target hit dead centre.
ach.target_120.name = Bullseye Sums
ach.taxi_300.desc = Score 1500 in Taxi Driver.
ach.taxi_300.flavour = A Avenue to H, 1st Street to 8th, and every fare on time. Suggested by germanico.
ach.taxi_300.name = Knows Every Corner
ach.telegraph_7.desc = Send back a message of seven taps.
ach.telegraph_7.flavour = Seven taps in order, shorts and longs, from one hearing. Operators trained for months to do that.
ach.telegraph_7.name = Fluent In Clicks
ach.tempo_lock.desc = Keep the beat for thirty beats in one game of Tempo Lock.
ach.tempo_lock.flavour = Round after round, tempo after tempo, thirty beats right on time.
ach.tempo_lock.name = Human Clock
ach.ten_games.desc = Play ten different games.
ach.ten_games.flavour = Ten cabinets tried. The room is bigger than it sounded on the way in, isn't it.
ach.ten_games.name = Ten Cabinets
ach.ten_hours.desc = Play for ten hours in total.
ach.ten_hours.flavour = Ten hours. This has stopped being something you tried.
ach.ten_hours.name = Ten Hours
ach.tennis_win.desc = Win a match of Tennis.
ach.tennis_win.flavour = Match won. You found the open court by ear every time.
ach.tennis_win.name = Straight Sets
ach.tenth_run.desc = Start the arcade ten times.
ach.tenth_run.flavour = Ten visits. The machines have started recognising your footsteps.
ach.tenth_run.name = Regular
ach.the_end.desc = Earn every achievement.
ach.the_end.flavour = All of them. Every cabinet, every mode, every distinction the Lab could teach, every secret. The lights are still on and the machines are still warm. Thank you for playing.
ach.the_end.name = Nothing Left To Earn
ach.thirty_days.desc = Play on thirty consecutive days.
ach.thirty_days.flavour = Thirty days in a row. At this point the arcade should be paying you.
ach.thirty_days.name = A Month Of Days
ach.thirty_games.desc = Play thirty different games.
ach.thirty_games.flavour = Thirty cabinets. There are corners of this place even I had forgotten about.
ach.thirty_games.name = Thirty Cabinets
ach.thousand_plays.desc = Score a thousand points in a single game.
ach.thousand_plays.flavour = A thousand points on one coin. The high-score table has noticed you.
ach.thousand_plays.name = One Thousand
ach.throw_500.desc = Score 500 in The Throw.
ach.throw_500.flavour = As far as it would go, and not one step further.
ach.throw_500.name = Right To The Edge
ach.tightrope_150.desc = Take a hundred and fifty steps on the tightrope.
ach.tightrope_150.flavour = A hundred and fifty steps of constant tiny correction. Nothing dramatic ever happened, which is the whole achievement.
ach.tightrope_150.name = Wire Walker
ach.tightrope_50.desc = Take fifty steps on the tightrope.
ach.tightrope_50.flavour = Fifty steps of constant small corrections. The trick is never letting it get big enough to need a big one.
ach.tightrope_50.name = Steady Nerve
ach.tincan_10.desc = Find ten weighted cans.
ach.tincan_10.flavour = Ten cans picked out of a rattling row. The difference is a couple of semitones and you caught every one.
ach.tincan_10.name = Weighted Can
ach.token_1.desc = Buy tickets from the token machine.
ach.token_1.flavour = Coins in, tokens out, and the tray rattling.
ach.token_1.name = Clunk
ach.tone48_top.desc = Reach the top tone in Tone 48.
ach.tone48_top.flavour = All the way to the top of the octaves. That took planning, not luck.
ach.tone48_top.name = Top Tone
ach.tour_done.desc = Finish a World Tour.
ach.tour_done.flavour = A whole world, cabinet by cabinet, in one sitting. That takes a different kind of stamina than any single game does.
ach.tour_done.name = World Tourist
ach.tour_five.desc = Finish five World Tours.
ach.tour_five.flavour = Five tours. You know this building's floor plan by its sound.
ach.tour_five.name = Frequent Flyer
ach.traffic_150.desc = Score 150 in Traffic Count.
ach.traffic_150.flavour = They came both ways at once, and you still had the number.
ach.traffic_150.name = Rush Hour
ach.transpose_500.desc = Score 500 in Transpose.
ach.transpose_500.flavour = The same tune, in any key you are given.
ach.transpose_500.name = Perfect Relative Pitch
ach.trees_150.desc = Score 150 in Tree Scout.
ach.trees_150.flavour = Every tree measured by ear, and every one exactly the right height.
ach.trees_150.name = Lumberjack's Friend
ach.truefalse_500.desc = Score 500 in True or False.
ach.truefalse_500.flavour = Not one wrong sum slipped past you.
ach.truefalse_500.name = Lie Detector
ach.tube_1000.desc = Score a thousand in Tempest Tube.
ach.tube_1000.flavour = A thousand points around the rim. You are thinking in lanes now.
ach.tube_1000.name = Tube Rider
ach.tube_5000.desc = Score five thousand in Tempest Tube.
ach.tube_5000.flavour = Five thousand around the rim. You have stopped thinking in lanes and started thinking in arcs.
ach.tube_5000.name = Rim Rider
ach.tuner_10.desc = Find ten stations.
ach.tuner_10.flavour = Ten stations pulled out of the hiss. The trick is trusting the moment the noise thins rather than waiting for certainty.
ach.tuner_10.name = Clear Signal
ach.tuning_10.desc = Bring ten notes into tune.
ach.tuning_10.flavour = Ten notes tuned by the wobble alone. That is the actual method, and you now have it.
ach.tuning_10.name = Piano Tuner
ach.twenty_games.desc = Play twenty different games.
ach.twenty_games.flavour = Twenty. You have now heard more of this arcade than most people ever will.
ach.twenty_games.name = Twenty Cabinets
ach.two_thousand.desc = Play two thousand games.
ach.two_thousand.flavour = Two thousand. There is no sound in this building you have not heard many times over.
ach.two_thousand.name = Two Thousand Games
ach.tycoon.desc = Earn two thousand coins across your career.
ach.tycoon.flavour = Two thousand coins earned, all of it out of your own ears.
ach.tycoon.name = Arcade Tycoon
ach.unaided.desc = Beat par on any cabinet with every helping perk you own switched off.
ach.unaided.flavour = The Coach went quiet, the Round Skip stayed in your pocket, and you did it anyway.
ach.unaided.name = No Help Needed
ach.unlocker.desc = Unlock five items.
ach.unlocker.flavour = Five keys on the ring. The building is opening up.
ach.unlocker.name = Key Master
ach.unlocker_20.desc = Unlock twenty items.
ach.unlocker_20.flavour = Twenty unlocks. There are doors here you have not even found yet, and you already have the keys.
ach.unlocker_20.name = Locksmith
ach.valves_300.desc = Score 300 in Valve Room.
ach.valves_300.flavour = Round and round and shut. Not a drop on the floor.
ach.valves_300.name = Pressure Handled
ach.vault_clear.desc = Clear a Vault board to a single peg.
ach.vault_clear.flavour = One peg left. The hardest ending in the oldest puzzle there is.
ach.vault_clear.name = Last Peg Standing
ach.view.desc = Press {confirm} to switch between earned and still to earn.
ach.view.earned = Showing: earned
ach.view.guide_tip = The Achievement Guide, at the prize counter, says what each one asks.
ach.view.none = Nothing left. You have earned every one.
ach.view.switch = Switch the view at the top of this list to see what is still to earn.
ach.view.unearned = Showing: still to earn
ach.visit_30.desc = Come back thirty days in a row.
ach.visit_30.flavour = A month without missing a day. The attendant knows your name.
ach.visit_30.name = Part Of The Furniture
ach.visit_7.desc = Come back seven days in a row.
ach.visit_7.flavour = Seven days, seven bonuses, and the biggest one on the seventh.
ach.visit_7.name = A Week Of Visits
ach.voice_swap.desc = Change the sound bank.
ach.voice_swap.flavour = Same effects, painted a different colour. Small change, whole new room.
ach.voice_swap.name = New Colour
ach.volume_down.desc = Turn the music down with page down.
ach.volume_down.flavour = Music down. Understood. Not every moment needs a soundtrack.
ach.volume_down.name = Turn That Down
ach.volume_fiddler.desc = Adjust the music volume a hundred times.
ach.volume_fiddler.flavour = A hundred volume adjustments. You are not playing an arcade, you are mixing a record.
ach.volume_fiddler.name = Sound Engineer
ach.volume_off.desc = Take the music all the way down to zero.
ach.volume_off.flavour = You have muted the soundtrack entirely. Someone worked hard on that, and it was me, and it is fine. The games still work.
ach.volume_off.name = Silence, Please
ach.volume_up.desc = Turn the music up with page up.
ach.volume_up.flavour = Music up. Good. It was written to be heard, not tolerated.
ach.volume_up.name = Crank It
ach.waiter_20.desc = Serve twenty tables in one shift.
ach.waiter_20.flavour = Twenty orders taken, fetched and delivered without once forgetting who wanted what.
ach.waiter_20.name = Employee Of The Month
ach.waiter_perfect.desc = Finish a shift without a single customer giving up.
ach.waiter_perfect.flavour = Not one walkout. Everybody got what they ordered, at the table they ordered it from.
ach.waiter_perfect.name = No Complaints
ach.watch_5.desc = Catch five intruders on the night watch.
ach.watch_5.flavour = Five caught. A building at night is full of noises, and you learned which one was breathing.
ach.watch_5.name = On Patrol
ach.watch_first.desc = Watch the arcade play a game for you.
ach.watch_first.flavour = You let the machine take a turn while you listened. That is the fastest way to learn what a cabinet's sounds actually mean.
ach.watch_first.name = Take A Seat
ach.watch_ten.desc = Watch ten demonstrations.
ach.watch_ten.flavour = Ten runs studied rather than played. There is no shame in it: every good player learned by listening to a better one.
ach.watch_ten.name = Student Of The Game
ach.weekend.desc = Play on a Saturday and a Sunday.
ach.weekend.flavour = Both days of the weekend. This is officially a hobby now.
ach.weekend.name = Weekend Regular
ach.weekly_1.desc = Set a score in the Weekly Challenge.
ach.weekly_1.flavour = Your name on this week's board, with a code to prove it.
ach.weekly_1.name = Week One
ach.weekly_4.desc = Play the Weekly Challenge in four different weeks.
ach.weekly_4.flavour = A month of Mondays, and every one of them scored.
ach.weekly_4.name = Weekly Regular
ach.whack_level10.desc = Reach level ten in Whack-a-Wave.
ach.whack_level10.flavour = Level ten: posts up for barely a second and nearly half of them bombs.
ach.whack_level10.name = Reflex Merchant
ach.wheel_100.desc = Stop the Ticket Wheel on the fifty.
ach.wheel_100.flavour = Braked four clicks early, and it came to rest right on the bell.
ach.wheel_100.name = Top Of The Wheel
ach.win_streak.desc = Win five games in a row.
ach.win_streak.flavour = Five straight wins. Whatever you have found, do not go looking at it too directly. It might get shy.
ach.win_streak.name = On A Roll
ach.win_streak_10.desc = Win ten games in a row.
ach.win_streak_10.flavour = Ten in a row. The arcade has stopped trying to beat you and started taking notes.
ach.win_streak_10.name = Untouchable Run
ach.window_only.desc = Try to buy something you cannot afford.
ach.window_only.flavour = You reached for a prize that was out of reach. Note the price. Go and earn it. It will still be there.
ach.window_only.name = Just Looking
ach.worlds_all_star.desc = Earn a star in every world.
ach.worlds_all_star.flavour = A star in every corner of the building, and the building has grown since you started.
ach.worlds_all_star.name = A Star Everywhere
ach.zero_score.desc = Finish a game with a score of zero.
ach.zero_score.flavour = A clean zero. There is something almost pure about it.
ach.zero_score.name = Well, You Tried


# ---- Other -----------------------------------------------------

acey.bet = Bet {v0}.
acey.deal = Hand {v0}. {v1} and {v2}. You have {v3} dollars.
acey.end = You finish with {v0} dollars.
acey.lose = {v0}. Sorry, you lose.
