career.wing.basement.name = The Basement Lanes
career.wing.basement.story = Under the arcade lies an old basement, dry and dusty, long enough for lanes and tables. Mo has been saving the toughest cabinets for down here. Make them sing.
career.wing.terrace.name = The Rooftop Terrace
career.wing.terrace.story = With every hall open, the town wants more. Mo points upward: the roof has room for a terrace of cabinets under the stars. The machines up there are for the best players in town, so show them how it is done.
