shortcut.list2 = Shortcuts that work anywhere: control L changes language, control S turns speech on or off, control M turns music on or off, control R repeats the last thing said, control G turns Genny's sounds and music on or off, control V turns self-voicing on or off, or pastes while you are typing. The review buffers: control left and right, or the brackets, move between them; control up and down, or comma and period, move through one, or change a volume; add shift for the first or last; control C copies the line you are on. Page up and page down change the music volume. Control K reads this list.
